<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">ƐBƐ IYI Ɔ ZƆ ƆZHƆNU</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">ƐBƐ IYI Ɔ ZƆ ƆZHƆNU</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ka kwokpo kwɔlɛ o ya wu te Onzu uwakɔ Ɔzhɔnu. Igbomo o ka kwokpo kwɔlɛ lɔri oderi ukpɛnyi dɛ gba o bo mba Ɔzhizɔsi le. O ka ngwu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ Wambwalu o ye mbo mu inyashi ilomo kwuwongu o kwu idu mbo o fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kaa lakwu Ɔkwu mba. Ɔzhɔnu tete o lo wu inyashi nzhii ba o to wu o shi wu mu kutashi ungwu Obatimosi. Mu kutashi ungwu Obatimosi gba o shi wu ɛbɛ ɛlɛ le. Ɔzhɔnu a ka mba kwokpo kwɔlɛ kaa la kamba ɛnwu ma, le shi mbo eyifulomo kaa le kyo le so mbo kaa lɔ rima ngiri mu imbwaluma kwuyengwu o ye mbo mu inyashi ilomo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwokpo kwɔlɛ kwu yi apula gyɔɔ iyi bɔkɔ o wo eduma mu lɔzɔ gba o ka yi le. Wambwalu umba kwuye kwɔngu o yi iyitu iyi lɔzɔ ndɔlɛ, umba bɔkɔ akwu wambwalu mo ba lɔzɔ ndɔlɛ akwu kwunvyeru munyi mbo. Iluma iyi apula iyi i yi mu kwokpo kwɔlɛ i yi ikikɔ ikikɔ, tetete reshi ingyi iso akwu rikpɛnyi ba ri ta kwudu pepee: Tee i zɛ mu Ɔkwu Okrasi, Ukpo a ngbɛ agewa wu ma lɛɛbi i kyo Osheta, enzu wu umba bɔkɔ o rima ngiri ba e shi mbo rigbɛ ingyi esheshi iyi oshi uwepo mbala ɛzhi iyepo kwuyengwu e ri agewa wu ma mu ewa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1-8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwupu ungwu o ka laa ɛshɔshi erewo (1.9—3.22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kwokpo ungwu ɔ ki ngwu urɔ mu riyi erewo (4.1—8.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">Angangarakyi Erewo (8.2—11.19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɔduragɔ mbala izɔfyi wepo (12.1—13.18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ɛbɛ ikikɔ ikikɔ (14.1—15.8)</para>
  <para style="io1">Lɔɔtu lorowo undu amba umba Ukpo (16.1-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Itama iyi Ɔbabilɔ, mbala irimo mu ewa iyi izɔfyi awu, anukenzu uwo angba, mbala Onzu uwoyi (17.1—20.10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Ombwu izɔma umbwambwa (20.11-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Oshi uwepo, ɛzhi iyepo, Ɔzhɛrusalɛ uwepo (21.1—22.5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Imbwama iyi iso (22.6-21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Kwokpo kwɔlɛ akwu ɛbɛ iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a wa yi a ta kwudu. Ukpo a zɔ wu apula ɛlɛ kaa la zɔ ɛmɛgba wu apula iyi bɔkɔ mɛga i nda laa iwomo fo. Okrasi a lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ wu mbaa Ɔzhɔnu kaa laa zɔ wu apula ɛlɛ, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />akwɛyi Ɔzhɔnu ba e so iyi bɔkɔ a ma lɛɛbi. Ɛlɛ gba akwiyi bɔkɔ a ma mekeka iyi iso iyi Ukpo mbala ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a wa wu a ta kwudu le. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu onzu uwu a wa kwokpo ungwu iso iyi Ukpo kwɔlɛ, mbala umba bɔkɔ o ngbɛ alu mu iso iyi bɔkɔ i yi mangwu akwɛyi o mbwalu yi! Moo kwuye kwu ndama fo bɔkɔ apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i bi wo.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhɔnu A Gbɛlɛ Ɛshɔshi Erewo Ɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Imi Ɔzhɔnu gba mi kakwupu kwɔlɛ le laa Ɛshɔshi erewo mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Esheshi mbala egbo-mɛzhi iyi bɔkɔ ii ngyi mbaa Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi kekelele, e yi mekyi akwɛyi a ba nyɔ, mbala mbaa ɛndu erewo iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu keyi unga ukpa uwɛsu wu, lakwu iyayi lɛɛbi, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />mbala mbaa Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, uwu bɔkɔ akwu u uzɔgɔ ongbulolo uwu Ukpo, uwu gba akwu uwu kwonze uwu bɔkɔ o yu wu mo mu kwuvɔ le, uwu tete gba akwu ɔsu uwu asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ le.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">E pwu idɛnyi nzu, akwɛyi mu lukwu wu, a wanzu ma mu ingbomo nzu, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />akwɛyi e shi nzu kaa la ki kwu wa ri ɛsu mbala ebwoshi kaa la ki wo ɛduma laa Ukpo Ete wu. Iduma mbala ɛsu irimo lakwu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi iyɔkpɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ! Liyi tayi.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Yese, e yi mu inyɔma mu amu! Uwewe a ma wu, ikyo umba bɔkɔ o la wu kwɔku. Enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi oo wo ubugyi kwuwo wu. Tegba ii wo le!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Ɔkwu Ukpo edego, uwu e yi kekelele, uwu e yi mekyi, uwu a ba nyɔ a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Imi gba mi kwu uwu kwonze mbala umbwa kembo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛbɛ Iyi Ɔzhɔnu A Ma Mɛka Iyi Okrasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Imi Ɔzhɔnu, umanyi yi u mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi, mbala umanyi yi mu idu iyimo mbala inyashi imama iyi bɔkɔ wa ri ɛsu mbala wu o ma. O ka mya mu kutashi ungwu Ɔpatumɔ kwuwongu bɔkɔ mi tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo mbala izɔgɔ mi izɔma meka iyi ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a wawu kwudu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungwu Ukpo ilɛma ungwu Ɔkwu, Kwundu e fye mami akwɛyi mi pwa opwu laa iso isomo gbogbogbo mizhikembo mi. Opwu ɔnwu u wanu kyamate kwongangaraki tayi. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Opwu ɔnwu u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ka kiya ingyi ŋɔ ma ka lɔ kwokpo kwɔlɛ laa ɛshɔshi mu ese iyi: Ɛfɛsɔ, mbala Osimina, mbala Opagamu, mbala Otiyatira, mbala Osadisi, mbala Ofiladefiya, mbala Olawodisiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Mi geleyi kaa la mi ma onzu uwu e yi mu iso isomo mbala mi, akwɛyi mi ma lɔna undu ɔyi undu egolu lorowo. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Mi kyo mi ma kiya kyamate onzu tayi, te a rima mekeka iyi lɔna undu egolu ndɔlɛ, e lo origa uwɔzhi uwu a bɔ wu mu atakɛzhi, a ma kiya ingyi ogolu mu idu.<verse eid="REV 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Inyi wu i wuluma puratata kyamate owuru nana akurungba tayi; eyi wu i yi kyamate ɔyi uwu bɔkɔ u yi mu izɛma baribari tayi.<verse eid="REV 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Alɛ wu i lemo kyamate kwoso kwofyobyo ungwu o pyipyi ngwu anyi tayi. Opwu wu u wanu kyamate embyi umba o yi mu ikalama moshi tayi. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />A rala elovyo ekperewo mu kwuwo ungwungyi wu, akwɛyi ukpandɛrɛ uwu lunzu lopo a wɔ mu kenzu wu. Ureyi wu u lemo kyamate ɔnu uwɔnɔnda tayi. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Tabɔkɔ mi ma wu, akwɛyi mi kpo mbwe midu wu kyamate ukpɛzhi tayi. E fulo mi kwuwo ungwungyi wu akwɛyi a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Ki wiyi mo! Imi gba mi kwu uwu kwonze le, Imi gba mi kwu uwu imbwama le. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Imi mi yi reyi! Mi kpomo dɛ, kekelele ba mi yi la reyi ŋa iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ. Mi rala anu iyi lukwu mbala aleku. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Kwuwo ngwɔlɛ, ka ŋanɛ, apula iyi ŋɔ ma; apula iyi kekelele mbala iyi i bi wo mizhikembo. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Iluma iyi kwunvyeru iyi elovyo erewo iyi ŋɔ ma mu kuwo ungwungyi mi, mbala lɔna undu ɔyi undu egolu lorowo ndɔndu gba i yi tee: elovyo erewo ɛnyi akwu alɔgbulɔ umba ɛshɔshi erewo ɛnyi, lɔna undu ɔyi undu egolu lorowo ndɔndu ba akwu ɛshɔshi erewo ɛnyi.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Ɛlɔgbulɔ Laa Wambwalu Umba Ɛfɛsɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />&lt;&lt;Ka ilɔ ɛlɛ laa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu ɔshɔshi uwu Ɛfɛsɔ kaa za wu tee:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">&lt;&lt;Ilɔ ɛlɛ i ngyi mbaa onzu uwu a rala elovyo erewo mu kuwo ungwungyi wu bɔkɔ aa zɛma meka iyi lɔna undɔyi lorowo undu egolu awu. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Mi yitu iyi ɛduma ŋa; mi yitu iyi ekpasu iyi ŋɔ yi mu iwomo mu ɛduma mbala idu iyimo ŋɔ. Mi yitu tee ŋɔ nyama laa enzu umbira umba bɔkɔ o yi meka yi awu mo, enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɔ tee o kwu wa zɛ ilɔ awu, ŋɔ pwa mba ma a ba ŋɔ zɔngɔma tee akwu tayi mo, akwu wamulo. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Mi yitu tee ŋɔ yidu. Ŋɔ ma inyashi kwuwo mi ee, tetete, ŋɔ fewo mo. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Tetete mi ma ifɔma ŋa: ŋɔ pwu idɛnyi mi kyamate ŋɔ koko ŋɔ pwu mekyi awu fo. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Yese mbaa bɔkɔ ŋɔ kpa mɛzhi! Lafya laa ingbomo ŋɔ kaa wo ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo mekyi awu. Gba ŋɔ lafya laa ingbomo ŋɔ mo, mi nyɔ akwɛyi mi kwu luna undu ɔyi ŋɔ ma mu riyi yi. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Tetete, iyi bɔkɔ mi pwɔ ŋɔ ma ma yi gba i yi tee: ŋɔ gyi apula iyi bɔkɔ Anikoleta o wo mo ndii kyamate bɔkɔ Imi mi gyi mo awu tete.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e yi alu, ba la pwa iso iyi Kwundu e yi mu isomo laa ɛshɔshi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">&lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e rimo ba mii shi wu ekpasu kaa le ri imuma iyi uwɛyi uwu bɔkɔ uu shi kwunyɔ uwu u ri mu Utu uwu Ukpo awu.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛlɔgbulɔ Laa Wambwalu Umba Osimina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />&lt;&lt;Ka ilɔ ɛlɛ laa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu ɔshɔshi uwu Osimina kaa za wu tee:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">&lt;&lt;Ilɔ ɛlɛ, i ngyi mbaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ uwu gba akwu uwu kwonze a ba akwu uwu u mbwama le awu, uwu bɔkɔ e kpomo akwɛyi a gba e yi lareyi. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Mi yitu iyi inyashi ŋɔ; mi yitu tee ŋɔ yi rewa, tetete ŋɔ yi kwuwo! Mi yitu iso iyira iyi bɔkɔ enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɔ tee ɔ kwu Azhu umba ba akwu Azhu mo o so mu reshi ŋɔ; umba akwu enzu umba Osheta! <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Ki wiyi iyi inyashi iyinayina iyi ŋɔ ŋi ma mo. Ngbɛ alu kaa pwa! Onzu uwoyi ee fu umbafo yi mu ugu ugyi kaa la pwa yi ma, akwɛyi ŋɔ ma inyashi iyi afyi uwo. Akwiyi o ngbɛ ŋɔ ma lala, rima ngiri akwɛyi mii shi ŋɔ rigbɛ ingyi kwunyɔ.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e yi alu ba la pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu e yi mu isomo laa ɛshɔshi le!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">&lt;&lt;Enzu umba bɔkɔ o rimo, lukwu undopo lu pwu mba afyi mo ndii.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛlɔgbulɔ Laa Wambwalu Umba Opagamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />&lt;&lt;Ka ilɔ ɛlɛ laa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu ɔshɔshi uwu Opagamu ka za wu tee:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">&lt;&lt;Ilɔ ɛlɛ, i ngyi mbaa onzu uwu a ra laa ukpandɛrɛ uwu e rimo uwu lunzu lopo awu. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Imi mi yitu tee mbaa bɔkɔ nɔ yi le, akwu mbaa bɔkɔ Osheta e yi ukpa uwu ɛsu wu le.Tetete ŋɔ rima ngiri, kwuyengwu o ngbɛ Atipa, u uzɔgɔ mi shɛ ma mu kwuse yi awu lala, ɛlɛ i shi ŋɔ kaa gba kembo mo. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Tetete luzɛ ŋɔ undufo lu she mi mo: enzu umbafo meka yi o mbwalu ɛzɔ iyi Obalamu uwu a zɔ Obalaki ɔgwuzɛ uwu u shi enzu umba Izirɛ kaa lo ngbomo. A bɔ ɛmɛ umba Izirɛ ewo kaa lo ri abwa iyi eshi mbala kaya itomo. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Tatayi ŋɔ yi enzu umbafo mekeka yi umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu ɛzɔ iyi enzu umba Anikoleta. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Tɔɔ, kwu ira ŋa ɔsu kekelele! Gba ŋɔ kwu ira ŋa ɔsu mo, mi ngbɛ kwuye mo akwɛyi mi nyɔ munyi ŋɔ akwɛyi mi rala ukpandɛrɛ uwu aa wɔ mu kenzu mi awu akwɛyi mi to ewa mbala ŋa.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />&lt;&lt;Gba ŋɔ yi alu, de ba pwa kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Kwundu e yi mu isomo laa ɛshɔshi!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">&lt;&lt;Enzu umba bɔkɔ o rimo, mi gyi omana uwu o nvye wu mo awu akwɛyi mii shi mbo. Mi kyo mi shi uwewe mbo, kwoki kuruwu ungwu bɔkɔ o ka ɛnyi iyepo mangwu iyi bɔkɔ onzu uwunawuna e yitu yi mo, onzu uwu a na ngwu awu kɛɛkyi gba e yitu yi le.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛlɔgbulɔ Laa Wambwalu Umba Otiyatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />&lt;&lt;Ka ilɔ ɛlɛ laa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ɔshɔshi uwu Otiyatira kaa za wu tee:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">Ilɔ ɛlɛ i ngyi mbaa Umɛ uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ eyi wu i zɔ ɔyi kyamate ɔyi uwu u yi mu ipumo tayi, alɛ wu ba i lemo kyamate kwoso ungwu o ngbɛ ngwu anyi tayi. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Mi yitu iyi iwomo ŋɔ, mbala idɛnyi ŋɔ, mbala i bɔ ngiri ŋɔ, mbala ɛduma ŋɑ, mbala idu iyimo ŋɔ. Mi yitu tee ɛduma ŋa iyi kekelele i ka iyi iyemo ma. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Tetete, iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo bɔkɔ i she mi mo gba i yi tee: ŋɔ yidu mbala okokpayi uwu o ya wu tee Ɔzhɛzɛbɛ, uwu a zɔ tee akwu ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu. Ɛzɔ wu i shi ɛmɛgba mi o tama mu iyama mbala abwa iyi eshi irimo. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Imi mi shi wu kwuye e kaa le kwu ira wu ɔsu, uwu ba a gyi tee la lafya laa kaya itomo mo. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mii ta wu mu kwugodo ungwu ofya mbala umba bɔkɔ o nɔ mbala wu awu. Mii wo mbo ɛlɛ kekelele, ba te o lafya laa ira iyi o wo mbala wu shoo. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Mi kyo mi ngbɛ wa mbwalu wu lɛɛbi ma, akwɛyi ɛshɔshi mi lɛɛbi o yitu tee mi yitu iyi egbo iyi uwewe. Mii shi uwewe rigbɛ kyakya mbala ɛduma iyi e wo.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />&lt;&lt;Lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu shimo mu Otiyatira bɔkɔ lu mbwalu ɛzɔ iyira wu ɛnyi mo awu, ba lu vɔngɔ apula iyi bɔkɔ enzu umbafo o ya yi tee &lt;kwunvyeru ungwu Osheta ungwu indomo&gt; mo, Imi mi so yi tee mi fulo yi ɔlu uwufo fo. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Lunyi ba la lu ra laa ingyi lu yi ngyi awu kpakiri nzhii ba mi byi bo. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o rimo bɔkɔ o wo nzhii o ka mu imbwama, umba o wo iyi bɔkɔ mi gyi mii shi mbo ɛsu iyi ɛzhi ikikɔ ikikɔ. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />O ri ɛsu mbala upi uwu kwoso, a shɛkɛ mba ma putuputu kyamate lu wu undu lo mbo tayi. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Mate bɔkɔ mi na idomo mbaa adami awu, mii shi mbo idomo. Mi kyo mii shi mbo kulovyo ungwu eyifumo.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e yi alu, ba la pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu e so laa ɛshɔshi!<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Ɛlɔgbulɔ Laa Wambwalu Umba Osadisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />&lt;&lt;Ka ilɔ ɛlɛ laa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu ɔshɔshi uwu Osadisi kaa za wu tee:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">&lt;&lt;Ilɔ ɛlɛ i ngyi mbaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ra laa ɛndu iyi Ukpo ekperewo mbala elovyo erewo awu. Mi yitu iyi ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ yi mu iwomo; uŋɔ ŋɔ yi kwɔdu tee ŋɔ yela reyi le byi moo ŋɔ kpomo-o. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, nyeyimo! Kiya ingyi ki shimo mu kwuwo ŋɔ ele, ra ngyi gbagiri kaa ri mbwa ɛdɔ ikpomo mo, moo mi ma tee ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ wo le, i di nyɔlɔma mu idu iyi Ukpo mi mo. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, lolo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ o zɔ ŋɔ ba lu pwa; mbwalu ngyi kaa lafya laa ingbomo ŋɔ. Gba ŋɔ nyeyimo mo, mi nyɔ kyamate uwɛlɔ tayi, ba ŋɔ yitu iyi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi bi nyɔ mo. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Tetete, umbafo yi bwɛ mu Osadisi o do tutu ekpayi mba ma mo. O lo yi ekpayi iruwu akwɛyi oo zɛma mbala mi moo o domo tee lo wo mbo tayi. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o rimo, o lo mbo ekpayi iruwu kyamate mbɔlɛ tete. Mii ngbɛ ɛnyi mba ma mu kwokpo ungwu kwunyɔ mo. Mi so gedegede midu iyi Ada mi mbala alɔgbulɔ wu tee, enzu mbɔlɛ akwu umba mi. <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Onzu uwu e yi alu ba la pwa iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu e yi mu isomo laa ɛshɔshi le!<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛlɔgbulɔ Laa Wambwalu Umba Ofiladefiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />&lt;&lt;Ka ilɔ ɛlɛ laa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu ɔshɔshi uwu Ofiladefiya kaa za wu tee:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">&lt;&lt;Ilɔ ɛlɛ i ngyi mbaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ akwu ɔkɛrikɛri mbala ongbulolo awu. Uwu gba a ra la ɔnu uwu Odevidi le. Gba a wu riku mo, onzu e do ngyi ikokomo mo, tatayi gba e koko riku mo, onzu e do ngyi iwuma mo. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Imi mi yitu iyi iwomo ŋɔ; mi yitu tee ŋɔ yi ekpasu gyɔɔ mo; tetete ŋɔ mbwalu iso mi ba ŋɔ lu mi afyima laa imbwaluma mo. Mi wu ŋɔ riku mo-o, onzu uwu e do ngyi ikokomo e yi mo. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Pwa! Uzhi uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu umba osheta awu, wamwangba mbamba, umba bɔkɔ o ya ɛmba tee Azhu ba o kwu Azhu mo awu, mii shi mbo o nyɔ o kwumo midu ŋɔ akwɛyi o yitu tee Imi mi pwu idɛnyi ŋɔ. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Kwuwongwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ mbwalu ɔkpa uwu mi shi ŋɔ tee yidu awu, mii gbo ŋɔ mo mu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu inyɔma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa lɔ pwa enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ ma lɛɛbi awu. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Mi nda la inyɔma fo. Ralaa kiya ingyi ŋɔ yi ngyi kpakiri kaa onzu la na rigbɛ ŋɔ ma mo. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e rimo, mii shi wu aakwu ope mu ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo mi, Onzu elete aa lafya la ɔtɛpu gbee fo. Mi ka ɛnyi iyi Ukpo mi mbala ɛnyi iyi kwuse ungwu Ukpo mi, Ɔzhɛrusalɛ uwepoo, ungwu kwuu wɔ moshi mbaa Ukpo mi akwɛyi kwu nyɔ mɛzhi awu. Mi kyo mi ka ɛnyi mi iyepo mamba tete.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Onzu uwu e yi alu ba la pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu ee so laa ɛshɔshi le!<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛlɔgbulɔ Laa Wambwalu Umba Olawodisiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />&lt;&lt;Ka ilɔ ɛlɛ laa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu ɔshɔshi uwu Olawodisiya kaa za wu tee:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">Ilɔ ɛlɛ i ngyi mbaa mi, Imi uwu bɔkɔ o ya mi tee Li yi tayi awu. Imi gba mi kwu u zɔ enzu ongbulolo uwu Ukpo shɛ le. Ingyi ma wu gba Ukpo e wo kiya ingyinangyina le. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />&lt;&lt;Imi mi yitu iyi iwomo ŋɔ. Uŋɔ ŋɔ tumo mo ba ŋɔ yi ɔyi mo. La ŋɔ tumo naa la ŋɔ yi ɔyi lala ba i bi she mi i ka le. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, tabɔkɔ ŋɔ yi wulawula bi, ŋɔ yi ɔyi mo ba ŋɔ tumo mo awu, Imi mi ŋi waŋa ma mu kenzu mi! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Ŋɔ zɔ tee, &lt;Imi mi yi kwuwo; mi yi kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ mi yi ugɔ ngyi.&gt; Uŋɔ yitu tee ŋɔ kwu onzu uwu inyashi, ŋɔ kwu ɔyirewa, uwu uzhiwidɔ, upeyi. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi ta ŋa amasa tee ya ogolu uweshi mbaa mi kaa yi kwuwo. Ya ekpayi iruwu kaa koko uzhiwidɔ ŋɔ ma. Kyo ya anyi umba ofya umbweyi kaa la meyi ŋɔ kaa ma ɛbɛ ɔnyɔnyɛ. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Onzu uwu mi pwu idɛnyi wu gba mi kpa wu ɛyi mi gbi towu mo le. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, gyakpɔɔ kaa tamɛzhi. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Pwa! Imi mi ri ele mu kenzugwu, mi yi mu kwuwo ilama mu riku; onzu uwu bɔkɔ a pwa opwu mi akwɛyi a wu riku ma, mi fyemo akwɛyi mi ri kiya mbala wu akwɛyi uwu tete e ri kiya mbala mi. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Onzu uwu e rimo, mii shi wu kapa kaa la ŋɔ la kpa mi mu ukpa mi kyamate mi rimo akwɛyi mi ŋɔma mbala Ada mi mu ukpa wu awu. <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Onzu uwu e yi alu ba la pwa iso iyi bɔkɔ Kwundu e yi mu isomo laa ɛshɔshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Ɔya Igbomo Moshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ akwɛyi mi ma riku ri wuma moshi, akwɛyi opwu uwu mi pwa wu dɛ-ɛ, uwu bɔkɔ u wanu kyamate kwongangaraki awu, u za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Yama kaa bo munɛ, kaa la mi zɔ ŋɔ kiya ingyi ki byi wo mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Mɔmɔɔmɔ akwɛyi Kwundu e fye mami akwɛyi mi ma ukpa uwɛsu moshi, onzu uwufo ba a ŋɔma mawu. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Ureyi uwu onzu awu u lemo kyamate ekyi iyi abwa iyi ozhasipa mbala okanaliya tayi. Ɔwɔ uwu bɔkɔ u yi kyamate embyi umba kwokyi ungwu ɛmɛra tayi awu ba u fula ukpa ele ma. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Ikpa iyɛsu uwekpepo laa endo ɛlɛ ba i lo ukpa uwu ɔsu ukpɛnyi ele mekeka. Enzumbakɔ uwekpepo laa wendo mbɔlɛ ba uwewe a ŋɔ mu ukpa wu uwɛsu wu, uwewe e lo ɔriga uruwu laa ɛnuma uwu ogolu mu reshi. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Imingɔma iyi lɔwu mbala ɛyikpama iyi Ukpo mbala ina ba i le mu iwɔma mbaa ukpa uwɛsu ele. Lɔmbyɔyi erewo iyi bɔkɔ akwu ɛndu erewo iyi Ukpo le ba i le mu ɔyi izɔma mu keyi unga ukpa uwɛsu ele. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Tatayi kiya ingyifo ingyi ki yi gelegele kyamate risu ingyi umɛbɛ tayi, ki yi mate Okirisita tayi, ki yi mu keyi unga ukpa uwɛsu ele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Apula iyi bɔkɔ i yi kwunyɔ endo ɛlɛ iyifo i yi mu kwuko kwɔlɛ iyifo i yi mu kwuko ungufo i yi eyi mu keyi mbala mizhikembo ba i fula ukpa uwɛsu ele ma tete. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Apula ireyi endo ɛlɛ, ingyi kwonze ki yi kyamate ɔbaga tayi; ingyopo ki yi kyamate endo ɔnumba tayi; ingyola ki yi ureyi kyamate ureyi uwu onzu tayi; ingyondo ba ki yi kyamate okpakukpaku uwu e yi mu iyimo moshi tayi. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Apula iyi i yi lareyi endo ɛlɛ, ingyinangyina ki yi ekowo ɛrɛnyi, ɛnwu mba ndii i yi eyi mu kwudu mbala mɛmi. La utu la ɔnu gba o ŋɔ sawu mu amu isomo tee,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:8">&lt;&lt; Ɔkwu Ukpo Edego akwu Ɔkɛrikɛri, Ɔkɛrikɛri, Ɔkɛrikɛri, U ka ekpasu le,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 4:8">mekyekyi, akwu uwu, kekele tete akwu wu, uwu gba ba e yi mu inyɔma le.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Kwuye ungwunanguna bɔkɔ apula iyi i yi laa reyi endo ɛlɛ i so amu iyi iduma mbala inzumbɛku mbala iyi ɛnyi igbɛlɛma laa onzu uwu a ŋɔ mu ukpa uwɛsu awu, uwu bɔkɔ e yi kwunyɔ iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ awu, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />akwɛyi enzu umbakɔ uwekpepo la wendo mbamba, o kpo mɛzhi mbamba mu idu iyi onzu uwu a ŋɔ mu ukpa uwɛsu awu, uwu bɔkɔ e yi kwunyɔ iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ awu, akwɛyi o gbo wu ɔya. O shi ɛnuma mba mu keyi unga ukpa uwɛsu akwɛyi o zɔ tee,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />Ɔkwu nzu, mbala Ukpo nzu! Ŋɔ domo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kaa na inzumbɛku, mbala ilomo mbala ekpasu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Moo uŋɔ gba ŋɔ wo apula lɛɛbi le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">akwu mu inyama ŋa gba apula lɛɛbi iwomo akwɛyi ŋɔ shi yi kwunyɔ le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Kwokpo Mbala Umɛ Uwu ilɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Akwɛyi mi ma kwokpo mu kwuwo ungwungyi ungwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma mu ukpa uwɛsu awu, kwokpo kwɔlɛ kwu yi ɛzu mɛmi mbala kwudu akwɛyi o kwungwumo akwɛyi o sengwu mo mu urɔ mu riyi ekperewo. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Akwɛyi mi ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwakuu uwu Ukpo, uwu a tanu mu opwu uwɔkwu tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe e domo te la mbumbu urɔ ɔlɛ ma akwɛyi aa wu kwokpo kwɔlɛ ma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Laa oshi, laa ɛzhi, laa mɛmi iyi ɛzhi ba o fya onzu uwu e domo tee aa wu kwokpo kwɔlɛ ma kaa le yese ɛmi ngwu mo. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Mi lɔga iyɛkɔkɔ kwuwongu o fya onzu uwu e domo tee laa wu kwokpo kwɔlɛ ma naa le yese ɛmi ngwu mo. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Akwɛyi onzu uwakɔ ukpɛnyi meka iyi enzu umbakɔ uwekpepo la wendo mbamba a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Ki lɔga mo. Yese! Ɔbaga uwu ɛdɔ iyi Ozhuda, uwu a wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Odevidi awu, e to ewa e rimo o. E domo te aa mbumbu urɔ erewo ɔlɛ ma akwɛyi a wu kwokpo kwongwu ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Akwɛyi mi ma umɛ uwu ilɔ tee a rima mekeka iyi ukpa uwɛsu ele mbala apula iyi bɔkɔ i ye la reyi ekpendo ɛnyi mbala enzu umbakɔ mbamba. Ilɔ awu e yi kyamate o ngbɛ wu ma a tayi. E yi ilɔ erewo mbala eyi erewo iyi bɔkɔ akwu ɛndu erewo iyi Ukpo iyi bɔkɔ o lɔ yi ma tee li so munamuna mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Umɛ uwu ilɔ awu a ka na kwokpo kwɔngu ma mu kuwo ungwungyi ungwu onzu uwu a ŋɔ mu ukpa uwɛsu. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Tabɔkɔ a na ngwu ma, akwɛyi apula iyi i ye la reyi endo ɛlɛ mbala enzu umbakɔ uwekpepo la wendo mbɔlɛ, o fo mbamba mɛzhi mu idu iyi Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu. Uwewe mbo a ra la kumburu mbala lɔbulɛ undu egolu undu bɔkɔ o nyɔlɔ nduma mu apula iyi umbwɔ ferere, ɛlɛ gba akwu kyamate Ukpo ilɛma uwu enzu umba Ukpo le.<verse eid="REV 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Akwɛyi o so kwɔmu ungwepo tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">&lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ fate to kwokpo kwɔngu ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">akwɛyi ŋɔ mbumbu urɔ ngwu ma kaa wu ngwu ma le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Moo o ngbɛ ŋɔ ma akwɛyi kwuwongu lukwu undu isabo undu ŋɔ kpo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">ŋɔ ya enzu umba ɛdɔ ikikɔ ikikɔ, lunzu ikikɔ ikikɔ, ɛzhi ikikɔ ikikɔ, mbala enzu ikikɔ ikikɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 5:9">akwɛyi ŋɔ ka mba laa Ukpo.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Ŋɔ wo mbo o kwu uzhi uwu ebwoshi umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma laa Ukpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">akwɛyi o ri ɛsu iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Mi gba mi yese, akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwu alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo guruguru tee o fula ukpa uwɛsu, mbala apula iyi i ye la reyi ekpendo ɛlɛ, mbala enzu umbakɔ mbɔlɛ ma, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />laa amu isomo mu opwu uwɔkwu tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">&lt;&lt;Umɛ uwu Ilɔ uwu bɔkɔ o ngbɛ wu ma awu e domo tee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">lo shi wu idomo, mbala kiya ingyi kwuwo, mbala ilukwu, mbala ekpasu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">mbala iduma, mbala inzumbɛku, mbala ipwɔma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Akwɛyi mi pwa kiya ingyinangyina ingyi ki yi moshi, mbala mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, mbala mu mɛmi iyi ɛzhi, mbala risu, apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ i yi ma yi, i so amu tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">&lt;&lt;Kwupwɔ, mbala iduma, mbala inzumbɛku, mbala idomo akwiyi onzu uwu a ŋɔ mu ukpa uwɛsu awu, mbala Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Akwɛyi apula iyi i ye la reyi ekpendo ɛnyi i gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Li yi tayi!&gt;&gt; Akwɛyi enzu umbakɔ mbamba o kpo eyi mɛzhi akwɛyi o gbo wu ɔya.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Umɛ Uwu Ilɔ A Mbumbu Urɔ Ɔnwu Ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Akwɛyi mi ma Ilɔ awu a mbwumbwu urɔ uwu kwonze ɔnwu ma meka iyi urɔ ekperewo ɛnyi, akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwu ukpɛnyi meka iyi apula iyi bɔkɔ i ye la reyi ekpendo ɛnyi, opwu ɔnwu u wanu kyamate ina tayi, u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Bo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Mi yese, akwɛyi mi ma onya uruwu mɔmɔ. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ya ma wu awu a ra laa kwoto, akwɛyi o shi wu ɛnuma, akwɛyi a wɔ kwudu kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ e rimo tayi. <verse eid="REV 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Akwɛyi Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu a mbwumbwu urɔ uwopo ma; akwɛyi mi pwa kiya ingyi ki ye la reyi ingyopo ngyɛngyi ki zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Bo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Akwɛyi onya ufyobyo uwufo a wɔ kwudu. O shi onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ya ma wu awu ekpasu kaa le bo la ewa itomo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, kaa enzu lo ngbɛ esu mo. O shi wu ukpandɛrɛ uwakwuu. <verse eid="REV 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Akwɛyi Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu a wu urɔ uwola ma; ba mi pwa opwu uwu kiya ngyi ki ye la reyi ingyola ki zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Bo!&gt;&gt; Mi yesemo, akwɛyi mi ma onya ugyi. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ya mawu le a ra la apula iyi oo mondo kiya ma yi. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Akwɛyi mi pwa opwu mekeka iyi apula iyi bɔkɔ i ye la reyi ekpendo ɛnyi, u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Omudu uwu Owiti ukpɛnyi akwu rigbɛ ingyi ɛduma iyi kwɔfyi kwukpɛnyi, emudu iyi ebali ekpela ba akwu rigbɛ ingyi ɛduma iyi kwɔfyi kwukpɛyi. Lunyi ba la lu tutu ɛwɛyi iyi olivu mbala utu wu ma mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Akwɛyi Ilɔ awu a mbumbu urɔ uwondo awu ma; akwɛyi mi pwa kiya ingyi ki ye la reyi ingyi ondo ngyɛngyi ki zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Bo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Mi yese, akwɛyi mi ma onya unzɔri uwu e ngyimo. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ya ma wu awu o ya wu te lukwu, aleku ba i mbwalu wu mu izhikembo kɛlɛkɛlɛ. O shi mbo ekpasu mu kwuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko endo iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa lo bo la ewa itomo, lonzu, efya mbala izɔfyi umbira kaa lo ngbɛ ngwu ɛdɔma.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Akwɛyi Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu a mbumbu urɔ uwɔlɔ ma. Akwɛyi mi ma mɛzhi bɛtɛ iyi kwola ungwu isabɔ ɛnyɔ iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o ngbɛ mba ma kwuwongu o tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo mbala izɔgɔ izɔma. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Akwɛyi o wanu mu opwu uwɔkwu o zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu Edego Ala, ɔkɛrikɛri mbala ongbulolo! Kwuye ungwuna bɔkɔ ŋɔ bi zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa lo mbo inyashi kwuwongu bɔkɔ o ngbɛ nzu ma awu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Uwewe mbo o shi wu origa uruwu, akwɛyi o za mba tee ɛnwu li gbo mbo mo li kyo bwɛ dɛ, kaa ɛmɛgba mbala wa mbwalu umbafo lo mbwamba ingbɛma dɛ kyamate bɔkɔ umba o ngbɛ mba tayi.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Akwɛyi mi ma Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu tee a mbumbu urɔ uwɔrɛnyi ma. Ɛzhi i wakpa iyira, ɔnu ba u vindɔ ma akwɛyi u yi kyamate okpayi ugyi tayi, ovya ba u vindɔ ufyobo akwɛyi u yi kyamate ɛnzhi tayi. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Elovyo i kalama i fu mɛzhi, kyamate imuma iyi uwɛyi uwu oboriyo iyi bɔkɔ i mbomo mo akwɛyi i kalama i fu mɛzhi kwuyengwu bɔkɔ kwokpo ungwu ekpasu kwu wo yi akpa tayi. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Akwɛyi oshi u tomo ndii kyamate kwokpo ungwu bɔkɔ o kwungwu mo tayi, akwɛyi lɔwa undunanduna mbala kutashi ungwunaguna o pya yi ma o shi riyi yi. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Akwɛyi asu mbala wa to keyi umba kwudu kwɔlɛ, wa to keyi umba asozha, wa yi kwuwo mbala umba ekpasu, mbala enzu lɛɛbi, enye mbala umba bɔkɔ akwu enye mo, o nvye ɛmba ma mu efyo iyi ekyi mbala lɔwa. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />O za la lɔwa mbala ekyi tee, &lt;&lt;Shiri kaa kpo ma nzu kaa nvye nzu mo mbaa onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma mu ukpa uwɛsu awu mbala amba umba Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Moo kwɔfyi ungwoyi ungwu amba mba kwu bo o, uwe bɔkɔ e do tee aa rima?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Enzu Umba Izirɛ 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ akwɛyi mi ma alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo wendo o rima mu eko endo iyi ɛzhi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, o yi mu igba la kwokpo kembo mu eko endendo yi, kaa ekpo li to mu ɛzhi nana mu embyi nana li fya mu kwuwɛyi kwunyinyi mo. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Akwɛyi mi ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwufo e ngyi mu ɔnuwu kwoto la urɔ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi la reyi awu. A ya alɔgbulɔ wendo umba bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo ekpasu kaa lo tutu ɛzhi mbala risu ma awu mu opwu uwɔkwu. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ awu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt; la lu tutu ɛzhi nana risu, nana ɛwɛyi ma-a mo, la ki wo ɛmɛgba umba Ukpo nzu kɛzɔ mu undu mbo dɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Akwɛyi o za mi tee enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo mbo kɛzɔ unga Ukpo mu undu mbo awu, akwu 144,000. O wɔ mu lunzu luwo la lopo undu Izirɛ ndɔndu. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Mu ɛdɔ iyi Ozhuda, o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ, mu ɛdɔ iyi Ɔrubɛ, o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ, mu ɛdɔ iyi Ogadi, o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />mu ɛdɔ iyi Asha, o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ, mu ɛdɔ iyi Onafitali, o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ, mu ɛdɔ iyi Omanase, o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />mu ɛdɔ iyi Ɔsamɔ , o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ, mu ɛdɔ iyi Olevi, o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ, mu ɛdɔ iyi Isaka, o wo enzu 12, 000 kɛzɔ, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />mu ɛdɔ iyi Ɔzɛbulu, o wo enzu12,000 kɛzɔ, mu ɛdɔ iyi Ɔzhɔsɛfu o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ, mu ɛdɔ iyi Obezhami o wo enzu 12,000 kɛzɔ.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛlu Ikpalama Iyɛkwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, mi yesemo akwɛyi mi ma enzu gyɔɔ o kpalɛlu onzonzu ukpɛnyi te e do mbo i wama lɛɛbi mo! O wɔ mu ɛdɔ, ese, ekeshi, mbala lunzu ikikɔ ikikɔ. O rima mu keyi unga ukpa uwu ɛsu mbala uwu Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu, o lo ɛriga ewururu iruwu laa epederi mu ewo. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />O yama mu opwu uwɔkwu tee: &lt;&lt;Isama i wɔ mbaa Ukpo nzu, uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma mu ukpa uwu ɛsu awu, mbala mbaa Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo lɛɛbi o rima o lo ukpa uwu ɛsu awu meka, laa enzu umbakɔ, laa apula iyi i yela reyi ekpendo ɛnyi akwɛyi o kwumo o kpo eyi mu ɛzhi mu idu iyi Ukpo akwɛyi o gbo wu oya, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />akwɛyi o zɔ tee &lt;&lt;Li yi tayi! Iduma, mbala inzumbɛku, mbala ilukwu, mbala ɛnyi igbɛlɛma, mbala igba, mbala ekpasu mbala idomo, lakwu iyi Ukpo nzu iyɔkpɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ! Li yi tayi&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Akwɛyi onzu ukpɛnyi meka iyi enzu umbakɔ mbamba e yo mi tee, &lt;&lt;Enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo ɛriga ewururu iruwu ele akwu umbana, ba o wɔ muna?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Akwɛyi mi gba opwu tee, &lt;&lt;Ada, mi yitu mo. Uŋɔ ŋɔ yi mbo.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Akwɛyi a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Mbɔlɛ akwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o lo mbo inyashi iyɛkɔkɔ ba o wɔma moloto. O gbɔ ɛriga ewururu mba ma mu ɛnzhi umba Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu akwɛyi akwu iru puratata. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Akwu kwuwo ngwɔlɛ gba o rima mu idu iyi Ukpo gba o wo wu ɛduma la utu la ɔnu mu ɔtɛpu wu le. Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma mu ukpa uwu ɛsu wu awu ee gbo mbo mo. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Lonzu nana ugbembyi u wo mbo mo gbee fo; ɔnu nana uzu uwunawuna u fu mbo mɛnwu gbee fo, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />moo Umɛ uwu Ilɔ uwu bɔkɔ a ri mbaa ukpa uwu ɛsu awu a bɔ mba eyi, akwɛyi aa za mba e rembo mbaa embyi umba kwunyɔ umba bɔkɔ o yi mu itumo awu. Ukpo ba aa nwu mba ɛnyɛ ma lɛɛbi meyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Urɔ Uworowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu a mbwumbwu urɔ uworowo ɔnwu ma, akwɛyi oshi u gbo ndii nzhii ba kwurizhi ungwu awa ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Akwɛyi mi ma alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo werewo mbamba o rima mu idu iyi Ukpo, akwɛyi o shi mbo angangaraki erewo. <verse eid="REV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwufo uwu bɔkɔ a ra la kaatu unga ogolu laa apula iyi umbwɔ ferere mɛmi awu, e bo a rima mu keyi unga kwumbu ungwu isabɔ. O shi wu otulare gyɔɔ kaa le kyo mu Ukpo ilɛma iyi enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi kaa le wo yi mu kwumbu ungwu isabɔ ungwu ogolu ungwu bɔkɔ kwu ri mu keyi unga ukpa uwu ɛsu uwu Ukpo awu. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Uwu uwu apula iyi umbwɔ ferere iyi bɔkɔ u wɔ mu ewo iyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu bɔkɔ a rima mu idu iyi Ukpo awu mbala Ukpo ilɛma iyi enzu umba Ukpo i ka moshi. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ awu e to kaatu unga otulare kanga, e to ɔyi mu kwumbu ungwu isabɔ kwɔngu akwɛyi a nyɔlɔ nga ma mbala ɔyi, akwɛyi e fu wu mu ɛzhi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ. Akwɛyi ina i tara anu, la kawu imingɔma, akwɛyi ɛzhi i wakpa iyɛkɔkɔ.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Angangaraki Erewo Ɛnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Akwɛyi alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo werewo mbamba o yi ɛnwu ma kaa lo kpa angangaraki ɛnyi.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu kwonze a kpa kwongangaraki wu. Akwɛyi akurungba mbala ɔyi, ikyo mbala ɛnzhi, i fu mɛzhi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ. Kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, ɔyi i pu ngwu mo, kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi ɛwɛyi mbala ɔsɛ uwu ewu u pu mo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="REV 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwopo a kpa kwongangaraki wu. Akwɛyi kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki yi kyamate lɔwa undɔkwuu undu bɔkɔ lu yi mu ipwumo tayi, o to ngye pyo o ta mu risu. Akwɛyi kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi risu kwu vindɔ ɛnzhi, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi apula iyi bɔkɔ i ye la reyi mu risu i kpomo, kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi ada iyi embyi ba i kpɛdɔma.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwɔla a kpa kwongangaraki wu. Akwɛyi kwulovyo ungwɔkwu, ungwu kwu yi mu ipwumo kyamate kambyɔyi tayi awu, kwu kala moshi kwu ta mu kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi ɛkwu mbala itumo iyi embyi. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />(Ɛnyi iyi kwulovyo kwɔngu akwu &lt;&lt;Wɔnu.&gt;&gt;) Kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi embyi kwu zɛ wɔnu, enzu gyɔɔ ba o kpomo kwuwongu bɔkɔ o wo embyi mbamba, kwuwongu embyi mbamba o zɛ wɔnu. <verse eid="REV 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwondo a kpa kwongangaraki wu. Akwɛyi kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi ɔnu o fya ngwu kiya, la kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi ovya, mbala elovyo, akwɛyi kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi ɛbɛ yi i tomo; kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛla iyi utu mbala ɔnu, ɛbɛ yi i tomo tete.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Akwɛyi mi yese, akwɛyi mi pwa okpakukpaku ukpɛnyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu luzɛ moshi a wanu mu opwu uwɔkwu tee, &lt;&lt;Kyakwokwo kyakwokwo! Ikyakwokwo akwiyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o ŋɔ mu ɛzhi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ kwuyengwu bɔkɔ alɔgbulɔ wala o bo kpa angangaraki mba awu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwɔlɔ a kpa kwongangaraki wu. Akwɛyi mi ma kwulovyo ungwu bɔkɔ kwu tama mɛzhi awu, o shi ngwu anu iyi kwuvɔ ungwu indomo ngwu kwu yi ibɔma mo awu. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Kwulovyo kwɔngu kwu wu kwuvɔ ungwu indomo ngwu kwu yi i bɔma mo awu ma, akwɛyi uwu ugyi u wɔ mangwu kyamate uwu uwu kwoba ungwɔyi ungwɔkwu tayi; ɔnu mbala oshi u shi ipwu kwuwongu uwu uwu kwuvɔ kwɔngu. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Akwɛyi ekeza i wɔ mu uwu ɔnwu akwɛyi i kpo biri mu ɛzhi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ, o shi mbo ekpasu kyamate iyi ana tayi. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />O za mba tee lo wo ɔsɛ nana ɛwɛyi nana apula iyinayina ira mo; o za mba tee lo wo enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi kɛzɔ unga Ukpo mu undu mbo mo awu kɛɛkyi ira. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Ekeza ɛnyi o nya yi ma tee li ngbɛ enzu mbamba ma mo, o shi mbo te lo lo mbo inyashi iyi ɛvya ɛlɔ bi. Ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ inyashi ɛnyi i bo yi, i yi kyamate bɔkɔ ena a la onzu mo tayi.<verse eid="REV 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Mu ɛvya ɛlɔ ɛnyi, oo gagyi lukwu ba o fya ndu ma mo; o gyi tee lo kpomo, lukwu ba lu ri enya luu shi mbo. <verse eid="REV 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Ekeza ɛnyi i yi kyamate anya umbinyi umba bɔkɔ o yi ɛnwu ma iyi ewa itomo tayi; o bɔ ɛnuma uwu bɔkɔ e yi kyamate ogolu te mu reshi mbo, ureyi mbo ba u yi kyamate uwu onzu tayi. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Inyi mbo iyi kyamate iyi ekokpayi tayi, ɛnyi mba ba i yi kyamate iyi obaga tayi.<verse eid="REV 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Idu mbo o kpo yi kwoso ungwu bɔkɔ kwu yi kyamate kwokpata tayi, ekowo mbo ba i wanu kyamate ata iyi anya ribariba umba bɔkɔ o pyipyi ada iyi anya o sheyi mo mbaa ewa tayi. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />O yi i zɛ mbala kɛtu unga bɔkɔ ke yi kyamate unga ena tayi, i zɛ mba ɛlɛ gba akwu ekpasu mba iyi bɔkɔ o ra yi oo wo enzu ira mu evya ɛlɔ ɛnyi le. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />O yi ɔsu uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu ɛsu mba irimo, uwu gba akwu ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu bɔkɔ akwu u to keyi uwu kwuvɔ ungwu idomo ngwu kwu yi i bɔma mo awu. Ɛnyi wu mu kenzu unga Iburu akwu Abadɔ; mu Agiriki ba akwu Apoliyo (iluma yi akwu &lt;&lt;U ngbɛ ɛdɔ ma.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Inyashi iyi kenze ɛnyi i bo-o; inyashi ekpepo ba i nyɔ mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ kpɔ.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwɔrɛnyi a kpa kwongangaraki wu. Mi pwa opwu u wɔ mu eko endo iyi kwumbu ungwu isabɔ ungwu ogolu ungwu bɔkɔ kwu rima mu idu iyi Ukpo awu. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Opwu ɔnwu u za laa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwɔrɛnyi uwu Ukpo awu tee, &lt;&lt;Lafya laa alɔgbulɔ wendo umba bɔkɔ o ma mba ma mu risu ingyɛkwu ingyi Oyufiriti ngyɛngyi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Akwɛyi o lafya laa alɔgbulɔ wendo mbamba mu kwuye kwɔngu, mu kwɔfyi kwɔngu, mu ovya ɔnwu mu kari kanga pwa, o shi mbo kaa lo ngbɛ kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛkpɛla iyi enzu ma. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Akwɛyi o so mi riba ingyi asozha umba bɔkɔ o ya mu kadu unga anya tee akwu ɛmiliyɔ ederi epo (200, 000, 000.) <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Akwɛyi mu ɛbɛ mi, mi ma anya umbinyi mbala umba bɔkɔ o ya mamba: o kpa kwokpata kwofyobyo ungwu bɔkɔ kwu yi kyamate ɔyi te mu idu, akwu kwuwembyi kyamate kwoki ungwu o ya ngwu te osafiri tayi, kwu yi embyi kyamate ona tayi. Eshi iyi anya umba inyi mbamba i yi kyamate iyi abaga tayi, akwɛyi uwu mbala ɔyi mbala ɔyi uwɔkwu u wɔ mu kenzu mbo. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Kuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ɛkpɛla iyi enzu o ngbɛ mba ma mu ira ɛnyi: ɔyi, uwu mbala ɔyi uwɔkwu uwu u wɔ mu kenzu unga anya mbamba. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Moo ekpasu iyi anya mbamba i yi mu kenzu mbo mbala mu i zɛ mba tete. I zɛ mba i yi kyamate akwu umba o yi eshi tayi, inyi mba gba ba oo ra yi o nɛ enzu kanɛ le.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o shimo bɔkɔ ira ɛlɛ i ngbɛ mba ma mo awu, o lafya laa apula iyi bɔkɔ o wo mu ewo mbo awu mo. O lafya a oya igbomo laa iyo uwoyi, na eshi iyi egolu, esiliva, esepo, ekyi, mbala ɛwɛyi, iyi bɔkɔ i mɛbɛ mo, naa i pwama mo, naa ii zɛma mo awu. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Umba tete o kwu ira ɔsu iyi enzu ingbɛma, emondo iwomo, kaya itomo mbala ɛlɔ iwuma mo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Ɔlɔgbulɔ Uwu Ukpo Mbala Kwokpo Ungwɛri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Akwɛyi mi ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu ekpasu uwufo a wɔ moshi e yi mu inyɔma mɛzhi. Amu i koko wu mo ɔwɔ ba u fula reshi wu mo; eyi wu i yi kyamate ɔnu tayi, alɛ wu ba i yi kyamate epe iyi i yi mu ipwumo tayi <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />A ra laa kwokpo ungwɛri mu kwuwo ungwu bɔkɔ kwu wuma. E fulo kwota ungwungyi wu mu risu ba e fulo kwota ungwɔzu wu mu ɛzhi, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />akwɛyi a yama mu opwu uwɔkwu mate abaga o wanu tayi. Mizhikembo iyi bɔkɔ a yama, ina ekperewo ɛnyi i kpa ɛyi. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Tabɔkɔ ina ikperewo ɛnyi i kpa ɛyi, Imi mi gyi te la mi ka ɛzu ma. Akwɛyi mi ba mi pwa opwu u wɔ moshi u siso tee, &lt;&lt;Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ina ikperewo ɛnyi iso awu shi ye kyoo; ki ka yi ma mo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Akwɛyi mi ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ mi ma wu te a rima mu risu mbala mu ɛzhi awu, e yi kwuwo ungwungyi wu mo moshi <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />akwɛyi a vungɔma e to la ɛnyi iyi Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ e yi iyɔkpɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ awu, uwu bɔkɔ e wo oshi, ɛzhi, mbala risu mbala kiya ngyinangyina ngyi bɔkɔ ki yi ma yi. Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Kwuye ingbɛma kwu yi fo! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ uworowo awu a kpa kwongangaraki wu, akwɛyi Ukpo a wa la kwunvyeru wu ungwu bɔkɔ e so ɛmɛgba wu, anukenzu awu kwudu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Akwɛyi opwu uwu bɔkɔ u wɔ mu oshi bɔkɔ u so mi iso dɛ-ɛ awu u so mi iso kpɔ tee, &lt;&lt;So kaa na kwokpo ungwu bɔkɔ kwu wuma bɔkɔ kwu yi mu kwuwo ungwu ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu bɔkɔ a rima mu risu mbala mu ɛzhi awu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Akwɛyi mi ka mbaa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu akwɛyi mi za wu tee le shi mi kwokpo ungwɛri kwɔngu. Akwɛyi a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Na kaa kwu; kwu wuma mu ubwu ŋɔ, mu kenzu ŋɔ ba kwuu nyima mate lotu tayi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Mi na kwokpo ungwɛri kwɔngu ma mu kwuwo wu akwɛyi mi kwu, kwu nyima mate lotu te mu kenzu mi. Mizhikembo iyi mi mbiri ngwu mo ba, kwu wuma mu ubwu mi. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Akwɛyi a gba a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ gba ŋɔ tanu iyi ilɔ iyi Ukpo ɛlɛ mɛga meka iyi ekeshi riba laa, ɛdɔ, kenzu, mbala asu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Azɔgɔ wepo Mbamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Akwɛyi o shi mi upi uwu bɔkɔ e yi kyamate upi uwu kasa ikpama, akwɛyi o za mi tee, &lt;&lt;So kaa kpa kasa unga ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo mbala kwumbu ungwu isabɔ, mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi mu Ukpo ilɛma mu ɔtɛpu mɔmɔ wa mba ma. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Uŋɔ ba ki kpa kasa unga okpulo uwu kwudu mo, kwuwongu o rangyi o shi umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo umba bɔkɔ o bo kpa ata mu kwuse kwu kɛrikɛri kwɔngu evya uwekpendo laa epo. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Mi lɔ azɔgɔ mi wepo mbamba ma, umba bɔkɔ o lo ekpayi iyi obobyi, akwɛyi o tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo mu afyi odubu ukpɛnyi la afyi ederi epo laa uwɛkpɛrɛnyi ɛnyi (1, 260).&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Azɔgɔ wepo mbamba gba akwu ɛwɛyi iyi olivu epo mbala luna undɔyi lopo undu bɔkɔ lu rima mu keyi unga Ɔkwu uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ le. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Akwiyi gba onzu uwunawuna a pwama kaa le wo mbo iyira, ɔyi uu wɔ mu kenzu mbo akwɛyi u pwu agewa mba ma; te gba onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a pwama kaa le wo mbo iyira o ngbɛ wu ma le. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Kwuye ungwu bɔkɔ o yi mu ilɔ iyi Ukpo izɛma awu, o yi idomo iyi kaa lo koko oshi mo kaa Ukpo le tumo mo. O yi idomo tete mu itumo iyi embyi, kaa lo vindɔ mba ɛnzhi; o yi idomo iyi kaa lo fu ira iyinayina mɛzhi i yi kwudu kwɔlɛ ta bɔkɔ umba o gyi. <verse eid="REV 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Kwuye ngwu bɔkɔ o mbwa ilɔ iyi Ukpo i zɛ ma, izɔfyi uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mu kuvɔ ungwu indomo ungwu kwu yi ibɔma mo awu e kiri mbo ewa. A byi mba ma akwɛyi a ngbɛ mba ma, <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />akwɛyi ɛkpɛzhi mba o fu mu ɔgwuzɛ uwu kwuse ungwɔkwu kwɔngu fyafya, mbaa bɔkɔ o kpa Ɔkwu mba mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu awu. Ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ i wɔ iyi kwuse kwɔngu akwu Ɔsɔdɔmu, nana Izhipiti . <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Enzu umba ekeshi lɛɛbi, ɛdɔ, kenzu o yese ɛkpɛzhi mba afyi ela la kwurizhi ba o shi te lo pwu mbo mo mo. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu lukwu undu enzu wepo mbɔlɛ. Oo wo odumudumu akwɛyi oo wo esu rɛshi, kwuwongu anukenzu wepo mbɔlɛ o lo enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ inyashi gyɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Mizhikemo iyi afyi ela la kwurizhi ɛnyi akwɛyi ɛnyɔ iyi bɔkɔ i shi onzu kwunyɔ i wɔ mbaa Ukpo akwɛyi i fye ma mba, akwɛyi o yimo o rima; umba bɔkɔ o ma mba o wiyi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Akwɛyi anukenzu wepo mbamba o pwa opwu uwɔkwuu u wɔ moshi u za mba tee, &lt;&lt;La lu bo kadu te!&gt;&gt; Tabɔkɔ agewa mba o yi mu iyesemo, akwɛyi o yimo o kama moshi mu amu. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Mu kwotota kwɔngu ɛzhi i wakpa iyira; akwɛyi kwukpɛnyi meka iyi ikama ekpuwo iyi kwuse kwɔngu kwu shirimo, ba o ngbɛ enzu edubu erewo mo. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o shimo o wiyi akwɛyi o du Ukpo uwu oshi ma. <verse eid="REV 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Inyashi iyopo ɛnyi i bomo-o,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 11:14">Inyashi iyi ɔla ba i ndafo!<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwongangarakyi Ungworowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uworowo a kpa kwongangaraki wu, akwɛyi epu iyɛku i wɔ moshi, i zɔ tee,&lt;&lt; Ekpasu iyi ɛsu irimo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kekelele akwiyi Ɔkwu nzu mbala Okrasi wu, uwu e ri ɛsu iyɔkpɔ ba ɔkpɔ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Akwɛyi enzumbakɔ uwekpepo la wendo umba bɔkɔ o ŋɔma mu ikpa mba mu idu iyi Ukpo awu o kpo eyi mɛzhi akwɛyi o gbo ɔya laa Ukpo, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />akwɛyi o zɔ tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu Ukpo Edego ala, Uŋɔ uwu ŋɔ yi kekelele gba ŋɔ yi mekyi le!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Ki gbɛlɛ ŋɔ ɛnyi moo ŋɔ rala ekpasu ŋɔ iyɛku ɛnyi ŋɔ yi mu ɛsu irimo-o!<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Enzu umba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ekeshi o nyɔlɔma mbala amba, kwuwongu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">kwuyengwu amba ŋa kwu bo-o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">kwuyengwu bɔkɔ oo zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Kwuye kwu bo-o ungwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ shi ɛmɛgba ŋa mbala anukenzu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">mbala enzu ŋɔ lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o wiyi ŋɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">laa umbɛri laa umbakwu lɛɛbi rigbɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">kwuye kwu ba bo-o ungwu bɔkɔ umba bɔkɔ o ngbɛ ɛzhi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ ɛdɔma awu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">o ngbɛ mba ɛdɔ ma tete!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Akwɛyi o wu ɔtɛpu uwu Ukpo mo moshi, akwɛyi o ma Kwokpati ungwu Iso Ishi mɛzhi kwɔngu mɔmɔ. akwɛyi imingɔma mbala ɛyi ikpama mbala ina, ɛzhi i wo akpa, laa akurungba iyɛku.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Okokpayi Mbala Izɔfyi Uwu O Ya Wu Ɔduragɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Akwɛyi kiya ingyi izele ingyɛkwuu ki wɔ moshi. Okokpayi uwufo, ɔnu gba akwu ekpayi wu le akwɛyi a ri mu kadu unga ovya akwɛyi ɛnuma uwu elovyo uwo la epo e yi mu reshi wu. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />A ra laa rifo ba a nda la kwomba fo, akwɛyi a tara oga kwuwongu ɛnyi mbala inyashi iyi kwomba.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Akwɛyi o ma kiya ingyi izele ingyifo kpɔ ki wɔ moshi. Akwu ɔduragɔ ufyobyo uwakwu, e yi eshi erewo mbala ilɔ uwo mbala ɛnuma mu eshi ɛnyi . <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Mu u zɛ wu gba ee pyipyi kwuko kwukpɛnyi meka iyi eko ela iyi elovyo iyoshi akwɛyi aa ta yaa pyo mɛzhi. Akwɛyi Ɔduragɔ ele a rima mu idu iyi oko ele, kaa le kwu wu umɛ ma kwuyengwu a mba ma. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Akwɛyi a mba umɛ ɔnzɔnu, umɛ ele a rala upi uwu kwoso e ri ɛsu mu ɛzhi lɛɛbi. Umɛ ele ba o bɛ wa ki akwɛyi o to wu o ka wu la Ukpo mu ukpa uwɛsu wu. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Oko ele a rima a ka mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara, mbaa riyi ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a nɔngɔ e she wu, mbaa bɔkɔ o yese mbaa wu nzhii ba afyi odubu la ederi epo la uwo ɛkpɛrɛnyi (1, 260).<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Akwɛyi ewa i yimo moshi. Ɔmakɛlu mbala alɔgbulɔ umba o yi muzhi wu o tewa mbala ɔduragɔ ele, ɔduragɔ mbala alɔgbulɔ wu ba o tewa mbala mba tete; <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />ewa ba i ri ɔduragɔ awu ma, akwɛyi uwu mbala alɔgbulɔ wu ba o nya mba ma te lo ŋɔ moshi gbee fo. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Ɔduragɔ umbirimbiri ele, o towo pyo o ta mɛzhi - ɔkwu uwekyekyi awu, ɛnyi wu akwu Onzu uwoyi nana Osheta, uwu bɔkɔ e kyoro kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi ma awu. Uwu mbala alɔgbulɔ wu o to mbo pyo o fu mɛzhi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwɔkwuu moshi u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Isama, mbala ekpasu, mbala irɛsu iyi Ukpo, mbala idomo iyi Okrasi i nyɔlɔma-a kekelele! Moo u mwilo uwu ɛmɛnɛ midu iyi Ukpo la utu la ɔnu awu, o ra wu ma moshi-e. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Umba o byi wu ma mu ɛnzhi umba ilɔ; mbala ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ umba o so awu; umba ba o wiyi iyi lukwu mo, o nyama tee o kpomo byi. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, lunyi umba oshi, mbala lunyi umba lu yi mɔmɔ awu la lu mwɔnyɛ! Eza ba i la laa ɛzhi mbala risu! Moo onzu uwoyi e bo mɛzhi mbaa yi, uwu ba a nyɔlɔma la amba, kwuwongu e yitu tee kwuye wu kwu shi bwɛɛ byi ŋa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Tabɔkɔ ɔduragɔ a zɔngɔma tee o ta wu mɛzhi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ-ɛ, akwɛyi e le mu oko uwu a mba umɛ ɔnzɔnu awu italuma. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Ukpo e shi oko ele ekowo epo iyi okpakukpaku uwakwuu kaa le yimo la rima le so mu riyi wu mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara, mbaa bɔkɔ o bo yese mbaa wu nzhii ba lɔri lola lakwurizhi, kaa ɔduragɔ awu la ngbɛ wu ma mo. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Akwɛyi ɔduragɔ awu a wala embyi mu kenzu wu mate risu tayi, kaa embyi mbɔlɛ lo so wu mo. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ɛzhi ba i mbwama laa oko ele; akwɛyi i ya kenzu ma akwɛyi i mbiri embyi umba bɔkɔ o wɔ mu kenzu unga ɔduragɔ awu ma. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Akwɛyi ɔduragɔ awu e wo amba mbala oko awu akwɛyi e yimo tee e to ewa mbala ɛmɛ wu umba o shimo awu, enzu umba bɔkɔ o lomo la iso iyi Ukpo ba oo mbwalu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi kwuyengwunanguna. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Akwɛyi ɔduragɔ awu a ri mu ɔgyɛ uwu kenzu unga risu.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Izɔfyi Wepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Akwɛyi mi ma izɔfyi tee e yi mu iwɔma mu risu. E yi ilɔ uwo mbala eshi erewo; kwulɔ ungwunanguna kwu yi ɛnuma ngwu, reshi ingyinangyina ba ki yi ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ i pye Ukpo ari. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Izɔfyi uwu mi ma ele e yi mate ikye tayi, atakɛzhi wu i wɔ iyi izɔfyi uwu o ya wu te ɔbiyɛ, kenzu ke yi mate unga ɔbaga tayi. Ɔduragɔ ele e shi izɔfyi ele ekpasu wu, mbala ukpa wu, mbala idomo iyɛku. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Reshi rikpɛnyi meka iyi eshi erewo iyi izɔfyi ele, ri yi mate o nɛ ngyi kanɛ ungakwu tayi, ofya mbɔlɛ ba u bomo-o. Izele i wo enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi ma akwɛyi o mbwalu izɔfyi ele. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Enzu lɛɛbi o gbo oya laa ɔduragɔ ele kwuwongu e shi izɔfyi ele idomo wu. Enzu mbɔlɛ o gbo oya tete laa izɔfyi ele, ɔ zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Uwe ba e yi mate izɔfyi ele? Uwe ba e do ewa itomo mbala wu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Izɔfyi ele o shi wu ekpasu te le kwɛnwu kaa le pye Ukpo ari, o shi wu kapa unga e wo ɛduma mu idomo wu evya uwekpendo laa evya epo tete. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Akwɛyi e le mu Ukpo ari ikpama, kala ɛnyi wu, riyi ingyi bɔkɔ e yi, mbala umba bɔkɔ o yi moshi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />O shi wu ekpasu kaa le to ewa mbala enzu umba Ukpo kaa le ri mbo mo, akwɛyi o shi wu idomo meka iyi ɛdɔ iyinayina, laa ɛzhi iyinayina, laa kenzu unganangana, mbala enzu umbanambana. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ o gbo awu oya , enzu umba bɔkɔ ɛnyi mba o ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu kwunyɔ dɛ gba o wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le awu gba o gbo wu oya mo le. Kwokpo ungwu kwunyɔ kwɔlɛ gba akwu ungwu Umɛ uwu Ilɔ uwu bɔkɔ o gbɛ wu ma awu.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Onzu uwu e yi alu iyi ipwama, ba la pwa!<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ o ka yi tee o yi wu mo mega o yi wu mo; onzu uwu bɔkɔ ukpandɛrɛ gba a ngbɛ wu le; mega ukpandɛrɛ gba a ngbɛ wu le. Ɛlɛ te i gyi idu iyimo mbala ikwu idu lu fulo meka iyi enzu umba Ukpo.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Akwɛyi mi ma izɔfyi uwufo, uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mu ɛzhi. E yi ilɔ epo mate ilɔ iyi oturukpe tayi, akwɛyi e siso mate ɔduragɔ awu tayi. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />E wo ɛduma mu idomo iyɛku iyi izɔfyi uwu kwonze awu la eye wu. Kwudu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o nɔ mangwu, e wo mbo megaa tee lo gbo oya la izɔfyi uwu kwonze uwu bɔkɔ kanɛ wu ke bo mo-o awu. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Izɔfyi uwopo ele e wo apula iyi izele iyi iyɛku; e shi kaa ɔyi lu wɔ moshi u bo mɛzhi leyi iyi uwewe. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Akwɛyi e kyoro enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kwuwongu apula iyi amɛ iyi bɔkɔ o shi wu ekpasu te le wo leyi iyi izɔfyi uwu kwonze awu. Izɔfyi ele a za mba te lo mbo u wɔ kaa lo shi umwɔ laa izɔfyi uwu bɔkɔ ukpandɛrɛ a nɛ wu kanɛ dɛ-ɛ ba e ye lakwunyɔ awu. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Ukpo e shi izɔfyi uwopo awu te le shi u wɔ awu kwunyɔ laa izɔfyi uwu kwonze awu, kaa u wɔ awu le siso akwɛyi i gba i ngbɛ enzu lɛɛbi ma umba bɔkɔ o nyama te oo gbo wu oya mo. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Izɔfyi ele e wo enzu mega, la enzu umbɛri laa umbakɔ, umba bɔkɔ o yi kwuwo laa ayirewa, enye laa umba bɔkɔ akwu enye mo, tee lo na kɛzɔ mu kwuwo ungwungyi mbo naa kwudu mbo. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Onzu uwunawuna e do te e to kiya a ya ma naa a ya kiya mo akwiyi gba e yi kwɔzu kwɔngu mo, inyi gba akwu ɛnyi iyi izɔfyi nana iwama iyi ɛnyi ɛnyi le,<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Ɛlɛ te i gagyi ilukwu. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi amasa e do te e yi iluma iyi iwama iyi izɔfyi ele, kwuwongu iwama ɛnyi akwu ɛnyi iyi onzu. Iwama ɛnyi akwu 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Umɛ uwu Ilɔ mbala Enzu Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Akwɛyi mi geleyi akwɛyi mi ma Ilɔ awu te a ri mu lowa undu Ɔzayɔ; enzu 144,000 umba bɔkɔ o ka ɛnyi wu mbala ɛnyi iyi Ete wu mu undu mbo o yi mbala wu tete. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwu u wɔ moshi u wanu mate embyi o yi mu irima, mate Ukpo a kpa ina tayi. Anu iyi bɔkɔ mi pwa i yi mate anu iyi enzu o yi mu kumburu ibyima tayi. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Enzu 144,000 mbɔlɛ o ri mu idu iyi ukpa uwɛsu, mbala apula iyi bɔkɔ i yi la reyi ɛlɛ, mbala enzu umbakɔ; akwɛyi o ta kwɔmu ungwepo ungwu bɔkɔ umba kɛɛkyi gba o do ngwu ivɔngɔma le. Umba kɛɛkyi gba o sa mba ma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ le. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Enzu mbɔlɛ akwu anzɔnu umba bɔkɔ o tutu ɛmba ma mbala eko mo, moo umba o do nɔ mbala eko dɛ mo. Umba oo mbwalu Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu munamuna mbaa bɔkɔ a ka. Umba o sa mba ma mekeka iyi enzu akwɛyi umba akwu enzu umba kwonze umba bɔkɔ o ra mba o shi Ukpo mbala Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />O yitu mbo te akwu enzu u mbo imwilo mo; ba o yi kwungbɛ mo.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alɔgbulɔ Umba Ukpo Wala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Akwɛyi mi ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwufo e yi mu iyimo moshi, a za la ɛlɔgbulɔ iyeshi iyɔkpɔ iyi bɔkɔ aa tanu laa enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ, laa enzu umbanambana, laa ɛdɔ iyinayina, laa kenzu unganangana, laa ɛzhi iyinayina. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Akwɛyi e siso mu opwu uwɔkwuu tee, &lt;&lt;La lu lomo la Ukpo la lu gba la lu du wu ma! Moo kwuye kwu bo-o kaa la zɔ ombu uwu enzu lɛɛbi. La lu gbo Ukpo oya uwu bɔkɔ e wo oshi, mbala ɛzhi, mbala risu, mbala itumo iyi embyi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwopo a mbwalu uwu kwonze awu, a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;A tama-a! Ɔbabilɔ kwuse ungwɔkwu kwu tama-a! Uwu uwu bɔkɔ e shi enzu lɛɛbi o wo atɛ, mu atɛ iwomo mbo mbamba o shi mbo kaa lo to kaya iyira iyira!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwola a mbwalu wepo mbamba, e siso mu opwu uwɔkwuu tee, &lt;&lt;Onzu uwunawuna e gbo oya la izɔfyi uwakwuu ele mbala u wɔ wu akwɛyi a gba a na kɛzɔ mudu wu nana mu kwuwo wu <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />uwu tete, Ukpo ee wo amba mbala wu iyɛkɔkɔ, ee towu mo iyɛkɔkɔ mu amba wu umbakwu mbamba! Enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛlɛ o lo mbo inyashi mɔyi mbala uzu uwɔyi midu iyi alɔgbulɔ wa kɛrikɛri mbala midu iyi Umɛ uwu Ilɔ. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Uwu uwu ɔyi uwu bɔkɔ u lo mbo inyashi awu uu yimo iyɔkpɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ. Ɛnwu igbomo i yimo la utu la ɔnu la enzu umba bɔkɔ o gbo oya la izɔfyi mbala u wɔ wu awu, mbala onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ kɛzɔ unga ɛnyi wu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, enzu umba Ukpo i shoshi tee lo yidu, enzu umba bɔkɔ o lomo la ɛrama iyi Ukpo ba o kwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Akwɛyi mi pwa opwu moshi u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ka ɛlɛ ma: I na mu ɔnɛ i sheye keyi, ɔnyɛ akwu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo mu ɛduma iyi Ɔkwu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Kwundu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ee te gba i yi le!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ɛnwu ii gbo mbo mo mu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ o wo awu, kwuwongu rigbɛ ingyi ɛduma mba rii mbwalu mba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilɔma Iyi Kwudu Kwɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Akwɛyi mi yesemo, ba mi ma kwɔmu kwuruwu, akwɛyi mi ma kiya kyamate onzu tayi a ŋɔma mangwu, e yi ɛnuma uwu ogolu mu reshi wu mbala kworize ungwu irimo kwu yi mu kwuwo wu. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwufo a wɔ kwudu mu ɔtɛpu akwɛyi e to opwu uwɔkwu la onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma mu amu awu tee, "Wo ɛduma mu kworize ŋɔ kwɔngu ka lɔ ewiri ma, kwuwongu kwuyengwu ilɔma kw u bo-o; kwuyengwu kwudu kwɔlɛ ilɔma kwu bo-o!" <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Akwɛyi onzu uwu a ŋɔma mu amu awu e to kworize wu pyo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, akwɛyi o lɔ kwudu kwɔlɛ ma.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Akwɛyi mi ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwufo te a wɔ mu ɔtɛpu moshi, uwu tete e yi kworize ungwu irimo.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwufo, uwu bɔkɔ ɔyi u yi mɔwu wu, a wɔ mu kwumbu ungwu isabɔ a ya ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a ra la kworize ungwu irimo ma mu opwu uwɔkwu tee, "Wo ɛduma mu kworize ŋɔ, kaa bɛ imuma mu utu uwu ovanyi uwu kwudu kwɔlɛ, kwuwongu imuma i mbo-o!" <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu e to kworize wu pyo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, akwɛyi kwu bɛ imuma iyi ovanyi, akwɛyi e to yi pyo mu kizɛ ingyi o pyiri imuma iyi amba umbakwu umba Ukpo. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />O pyiri imuma iyi uwɛyi iyi ovanyi ɛlɛ mu kizɛ ingyi o pyiri imuma mizhikembo iyi kwuse, akwɛyi ɛnzhi o wɔ mu kizɛ ingyi o pyiri ovanyi ɛlɛ, gba o kpa ngyi kasa, indama ngyi i yi emelu ederi epo tayi, akwɛyi indomo ngyi i yi mate ata ɛlɔ tayi.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Alɔgbulɔ Umba Ukpo Umba Bɔkɔ O Ra laa Inyashi Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Akwɛyi mi ma kɛzɔ ungakwuu ungafo, unga izele moshi. Alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo werewo o ra laa inyashi erewo, inyi gba akwu iyi imbwambwa le, kwuwongu inyi gba akwu izɔma iyi amba umba Ukpo wa mbwambwa le.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Akwɛyi mi ma kiya mate risu ingyi umɛbɛ ki vyima mbala ɔyi. Mi gba mi ma enzu umba bɔkɔ o ri izɔfyi mbala u wɔ wu ma mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ kɛzɔ gba akwu ɛnyi mba le awu. Enzu mbamba o ri mu kenzu unga risu ingyi umɛbɛ ngyɛngyi, o ra la emburu iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mbo <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />akwɛyi o so kwɔmu ungwu Omosis, Umɛgba uwu Ukpo, mbala kwɔmu ungwu Umɛ Ilɔ awu tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">&lt;&lt;Ɔkwu Ukpo edego-ala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">ɛduma ŋa akwu iyɛku ba i yi izele!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Ɔsu uwu ɛzhi lɛɛbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">ɛgwuzɛ ŋɔ akwu ongbulolo mbala ototo!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ɔkwu, uwe ba a wiyi ŋɔ mo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Uwe ba a nyama tee aa du ŋɔ ma mo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Moo uŋɔ kɛɛkyi gba ŋɔ yi kɛrikɛri le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Enzu lɛɛbi o nyɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">akwɛyi oo gbo ŋɔ oya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">kwuwongu o ma ɛduma ŋa iyi ototo lɛɛbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ, akwɛyi mi ma ɔtɛpu moshi te e yɛwu, Kwunu Ɔkɛrikɛri ba kwu yi mangwu. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Akwɛyi alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo werewo umba bɔkɔ o ra la inyashi ekperewo, o wɔma mu ɔtɛpu awu, o lo apula ɛsɛsɛ iyi ɔlinɛ iyi ilemo akwɛyi o ma kwumagba ungwu ogolu mu idu mbo. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Akwɛyi ukpɛnyi meka iyi apula iyi i yi la reyi endo ɛnyi i shi alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo mbamba lɔɔtu lorowo undu egolu la amba umba Ukpo duduu, uwu bɔkɔ e yi iyɔkpɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Uwu uwu bɔkɔ u ngyi mbaa inzumbɛku mbala idomo iyi Ukpo u nyɔlɔ Ɔtɛpu awu ma, akwɛyi onzu u domo tee e fyemo mu ɔtɛpu awu e yi mo nzhii ba inyashi erewo iyi bɔkɔ alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo o bo yi awu i bomo dɛ.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Lɔɔtu Undu Amba Umba Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwɔkwuu u wɔ mu ɔtɛpu u siso mbala alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo werewo mbamba tee, &lt;&lt;So kaa fu lɔɔtu lorowo undu amba umba Ukpo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu kwonze a ka akwɛyi e fu kaatu ungawu mu kwudu kwɔlɛ, akwɛyi ashinakpa iyira mbala iyi iyimo shariri i wɔ mu enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi kɛzɔ unga izɔfyi awu mbala enzu umba o gbo oya la u wɔ wu.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwopo awu e fu ungawu mu risu. Embyi o vindɔ kyamate ɛnzhi umba ukpɛzhi tayi, akwɛyi ba kiya ki ye la reyi ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu embyi mbamba ki kpomo.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwola e fu ungawu wu mu ɛkwu mbala mbaa bɔkɔ embyi o tumo, akwɛyi o vindɔ ɛnzhi. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Akwɛyi mi pwa ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi ekpasu meka iyi embyi awu a zɔ tee: &lt;&lt;Ombwu uwu ŋɔ zɔ awu akwu ongbulolo, Ee Uŋɔ Ɔkɛrikɛri, uŋɔ uwu ŋɔ yi kekelele ŋɔ gba ŋɔ yi mekyi! <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Moo enzu mbɔlɛ o ngbɛ enzu umba Ukpo mbala anukenzu umba Ukpo ma, kwuwo kwɔlɛ ŋɔ shi mbo ɛnzhi te lo wo. O fya rigbɛ ingyi ki fa ma mba!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwu bɔkɔ u wɔ mu kwumbu ungwu isabɔ u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔkwu Ukpo Edego! Embu ŋɔ izɔma akwu ongbulolo ba i pulemo mo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwondo awu e fulo inyashi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kaatu wu awu e fu mɔnu, akwɛyi ba o shi ɔnu ekpasu tee lu pwu enzu mu iyimo wu. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Akwɛyi iyimo iyɛkɔkɔ iyi ɔnu ɛlɛ i pwu enzu ma, akwɛyi o pe ɛnyi iyi Ukpo ari, uwu bɔkɔ e yi idomo meka iyi inyashi ɛlɛ. Umba o ta mɛzhi mo ba o du inzumbɛku wu ma mo. <verse eid="REV 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwɔlɔ e fulo inyashi iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kaatu wu ma e fu mu ukpa uwu izɔfyi ele. Ipwu i kpo mu ɛzhi iyi izɔfyi ele, inyashi iyɛku i du enzu mbɔlɛ akwɛyi o le mu ɛtunɛ mba ɛnyi ikwumo, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />akwɛyi o pe Ukpo uwoshi ari kwuwongu inyashi mbala ashinakpa mba ba o lafya la ira mba iwomo mo.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwɔrɛnyi e fu umba kaatu wu ma mu embyi umba risu ingyi Oyufiriti. Akwɛyi risu ngyɛngyi ri shirima, kaa ri shi ɔgwuzɛ laa asu umba bɔkɔ o ngyi mu ɔnu uwu kwoto awu. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Akwɛyi mi ma ɛndu iyira ɛla iyi bɔkɔ o yi mate angbɔrɔ tayi. I le mu iwɔma mu kenzu unga ɔduragɔ, mbala kenzu unga izɔfyi mbala kenzu unga anukenzu u mwilo awu. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Inyi gba akwu ɛndu iyi eyi iyi bɔkɔ ii wo apula iyi amɛ awu. Ɛndu iyi eyi ɛla ɛlɛ ii ka mbaa asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi kaa lo kpalamba ɛlu kwuwongu ewa iyi Kwɔfyi Ungwɔkwu ungwu Ukpo Edego-ala.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />&lt;&lt;La lu ngbɛndu! Imi mi yi mu inyɔma mate uwɛlɔ tayi! Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma la reyi mbala ekpayi wu kɛlɛ, kaa la gɔma la uzhi uwu idɔ akwɛyi lovya ba la lu wo wu mu eyi iyi enzu mo&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Akwɛyi ɛndu ɛlɛ i kpala asu mbɔlɛ ɛlu mu riyi ingyi o ya ngyi mu Iburu tee Amagɛdɔ.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uworo awu e fulo kaatu wu ma e fu moshi. Akwɛyi opwu uwɔkwuu u wɔ mu ukpa uwɛsu awu mu ɔtɛpu u zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ɔ mbwa-a!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Akwɛyi Ukpo a zɔ kawu mbala ɛyi ikpama, mbala i dungɔma, akwɛyi ɛzhi i wo akpa iyɛku iyi bɔkɔ i di wo dɛ mo tabɔkɔ Ukpo e wo onzu le; ɛzhi i dungɔma ɛlɛ ikika le. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Ɛzhi i dungɔma ɛlɛ i ka kwuse ungwɔkwu kwɔlɛ ma yaa ekpela, akwɛyi ese iyɛku iyi ekeshi lɛɛbi i shirimo. Ukpo ba e lolo mbaa Ɔbabilɔ kwuse ungwɔku akwɛyi Ukpo e shi mbo o wo ago iyi bɔkɔ i nyɔlɔma la amba wu umba umbakwu. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Itashi lɛɛbi i tomo ndii, lɔwa undɔkwuu ba o ma ndu fo ndii. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Akwɛyi akurungba iyɛku, ɔlu yi i yi mate ekilo uwɛkpɛlɔ tayi, i ngyi moshi i fu mu enzu umba bɔkɔ o pe Ukpo ari kwuwongu inyashi iyɛku iyi akurungba ɛlɛ, kwuwongu inyashi ɛlɛ akwu iyɛku.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">U tokaya Ogiga Awu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Akwɛyi ukpɛnyi meka iyi alɔgbulɔ werewo umba bɔkɔ o yi lɔɔtu lorowo awu e bo munyi mi akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Bo, akwɛyi mi zɔ ŋɔ ewo iyi bɔkɔ u to kaya ogiga awu o lo wu inyashi, kwuse ungwu bɔkɔ o mbo ngwu kɛlɛ mbala ɛkwu awu. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o to kaya mbala wu, akwɛyi enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o wo atɛ o yi mbo mo, atɛ umba kaya itomo mbala wu.<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Kwundu e fye ma mi, akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo e to mi a ka mu ɛzhi ɛngbarara. Akwɛyi mi ma okokpayi mɔmɔ tee a ŋɔma mu izɔfyi ufyobyo uwu bɔkɔ ɛnwu wu lɛɛbi o ka ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ i pe Ukpo ari; izɔfyi awu e yi eshi ekperewo mbala ilɔ uwo. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Okokpayi awu e lo apula ifyobyo, iyi bɔkɔ o ki yi egolu, ekyi iyi abwa mbala apula iyi abwa. A rala ago iyi egolu mu kwuwo wu iyi bɔkɔ i nyɔlɔma laa apula iyi kashi mbala ɛnyinyi, iyi bɔkɔ i shi wu e to kaya. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Mu undu wu o ka ɛnyi iyi kwunvyeru iyi bɔkɔ iluma yi akwu: &lt;&lt;Ɔbabilɔ Uwakwuu, anyi uwu atokaya lɛɛbi mbala apula iyi kashi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Akwɛyi mi ma oko awu te ɛnzhi umba enzu umba Ukpo mbala ɛnzhi umba enzu umba bɔkɔ o ngbɛ mba ma kwuwongu anu itama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi o yi wu mo tayi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Tabɔkɔ mi ma wu, akwɛyi mi ya kenzu gyɔɔ. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu e yo mi kwuyo tee, &lt;&lt;Kimbe ki shi ba ŋɔ ya kenzu?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Imi mi wu ŋɔ kwunvyeru ungwu oko le ma mbala izɔfyi uwu bɔkɔ e shi wu awu, izɔfyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi eshi erewo mbala ilɔ uwo awu. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Izɔfyi awu e yi la reyi dɛ-ɛ, kekelele ba e yi la reyi fo; a ŋa wɔ mu kwuvɔ ungwu indomo ungwu kwu yi ibɔma mo awu akwɛyi e re mbaa o ngbɛ wu ɛdɔma. Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ umba bɔkɔ o ka ɛnyi mba ma mu kwokpo ungwu kwunyɔ dɛ gba o wo kwudu kwɔlɛ le awu, o ya kenzu tabɔkɔ o yese izɔfyi awu. E yi la reyi dɛ-ɛ; kekelele ba e yi la reyi fo, uwu ba a gba a wɔ kpɔ.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Iso ɛlɛ i gyi ilukwu mbala izɔngɔma. Eshi erewo ɛnyi akwu edudu erewo, iyi bɔkɔ oko awu a ŋɔma ma yi. Eshi erewo ɛnyi akwu asu werewo tete: <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Asu mba walɔ o kpo mo-o, ukpɛnyi e yi mu ɛsu irimo bɛnɛ, uwufo ba e de bo mo bɛnɛ; kwuyengwu e bo, e ri ɛsu kwuye bwɛɛ bi. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Izɔfyi uwu bɔkɔ e yi la reyi dɛ-ɛ, kekelele ba e yi la reyi fo awu, uwu mafyi wu gba akwu ɔsu uwu oranda uwu bɔkɔ akwu ukpɛnyi meka iyi werewo mbamba akwɛyi o ngbɛ wu ɛdɔma ma. <verse eid="REV 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />&lt;&lt;Ilɔ uwo iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ ma awu akwu asu wewo umba bɔkɔ o ye la ɛsu irimo mo bɛnɛ, umba ba o shi mbo idomo iyi ɛsu irimo mu kwuye bwɛɛ kya mbala izɔfyi awu. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Asu wewo mbɔlɛ egbo mbo akwu ikpɛnyi, akwɛyi o shi ekpasu mba mbala idomo mbo laa izɔfyi awu. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />O to ewa mbala Umɛ uwu ilɔ awu; Umɛ ilɔ awu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ a ya mba ma, a ŋa mba, a nyama la mba ba o byi mba ma.&gt;&gt; Kwuwongwu uwu gba akwu Ɔkwu uwu akwu mbala Ɔsu uwu asu le.<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a gba a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Embyi umba bɔkɔ ŋɔ ma awu, umba bɔkɔ u to kaya a ŋɔ mamba awu, akwu ɛzhi, enzu, ɛdɔ mbala lunzu. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Ilɔ uwo iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ ma yi awu mbala izɔfyi awu o wo anya iyi oko u to kaya awu; o kwu apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ e yi yi awu ma akwɛyi o lu wu afyima la uzhi uwidɔɔ; o kwu ivye iyi ɛnwu wu ma akwɛyi o pwu wu mo mu ɔyi. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Moo Ukpo e to egbo ɛnyi a ta yi mba mu egbo mbo-o, kaa lo wo iyi bɔkɔ a gyi laa egbo ikpɛnyi akwɛyi o shi izɔfyi awu ekpasu mba kaa le ri ɛsu nzhii ba kwuyengwu iso iyi Ukpo i nyɔlɔma.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />&lt;&lt;Oko uwu bɔkɔ ŋɔ ma awu akwu kwuse ungwɔkwu kwɔngu ungwu bɔkɔ kwu ri ɛsu meka iyi asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Itama Iyi Kwuse Ungwu Ɔbabilɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ mi ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwufo tee a wɔ moshi e yi mu inyɔma mɛzhi. E yi idomo iyɛku, ilemo wu i shi ɛzhi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi ɛbɛ. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />A tara oga mu opwu uwɔkwuu tee: &lt;&lt;A ta ma-a! Ɔbabilɔ Uwakwuu a ta ma-a! Kekelele akwu kizɛ ingyi invyemo ingyi eyo umbeyi mbala ɛndu iyira; ɛnyinyi ikikɔ ikikɔ mbala afyi umboshi umba bɔkɔ o gyi mba mo gba o kpo mɔmɔ le ŋa. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Moo ɛzhi iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi o wo atɛ umba oko awu-o, atɛ umba ekpasu iyi kaya itomo wu. Asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o to kaya mbala wu, wa ya rishi umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o yi kwuwo kwuwongu kaya itomo wu kanga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Akwɛyi mi pwa opwu uwufo u wɔ moshi, u zɔ tee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">&lt;&lt;enzu mi! La lu wɔ kwudu, La lu wɔma munyi wu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">La lu kyo mu ingbomo wu mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">kaa inyashi wu li du yi mo!<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Moo ingbomo wu i kpala ɛlu i ka moshi-e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">akwɛyi Ukpo e lolo ingbomo wu.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />La lu wo wu pwaa mate bɔkɔ e wo yi awu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Apula lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ e wo yi awu la lu wa wu kwusa yi izhepo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Apula iyi bɔkɔ e yoro yi mo e shi yi awu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">La lu nyɔlɔ ago wu ma mu atɛ umba bɔkɔ o ka ekpasu laa umba bɔkɔ e shi yi awu izhepo.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />La lu lo wu inyashi mbala ubugyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">kyamate bɔkɔ e to ɛnwu e fulo kadu laa ɔnyɛ uwu bɔkɔ e shi ɛnwu wu awu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Moo e koko e so ɛnwu wu tee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">&lt;Mi ŋɔ le munɛ, ɔsu okokpayi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Imi mi kwu oko u kpo ɔnu ma mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Mi yi ubugyi gbee mo!&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ubugyi uwu lukwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">mbala obobyi mbala lonzu lu kpo mu Ɔbabilɔ kwɔfyi kukpɛnyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Akwɛyi o pwu wu mo mɔyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">kwuwongu Ɔkwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ ombu wu awu, e yi ekpasu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ umba bɔkɔ o kyo mu kaya itomo mbala apula iyira iwomo mbala wu awu o lo oga o wa la ɛnyɛ kwuwongu kwuse kwɔngu kwuyengwu bɔkɔ o ma uwu uwɔyi uwu bɔkɔ u ye wo mu ipwumo. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />O ri shaaru, kwuwongu o wiyi iyi i kyo mu inyashi wu. O zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Kyakwokwo! kyakwokwo! Ɔbabilɔ! Kwuse ungwɔkwu kwɔlɛ! Mu awa ikpɛnyi byi akwɛyi o lo ŋɔ inyashi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Wa ya rishi umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o lo oga akwɛyi o wo obobyi kwuwo ungwu Ɔbabilɔ tete, moo onzu ukpukpɛnyi te a ya ewulo mbo fo, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />onzu ukpukpɛnyi te a ya apula mba fo, inyi gba akwu egolu, esiliva, ekyi iyi abwa mbala ekyi ilemo; apula mba iyi ɔlinɛ, mbala ekpayi ifyobyo, osiliki, mbala ekpayi ifyobyo; apula ikikɔ iyi abɛ mbala apula ikikɔ ikikɔ iyi esepo mbala abɛ iyi abwa, esepo mbala omabo; <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />mbala ɔsinamɔ, apula iyi umbwɔ ferere, otulare uwɔyi, omiri, ɛfurakisɛ, atɛ mbala anyi, umbwu mbala owiti, endo mbala ilɔ mbala anya mbala ada iyi ewa, enye mbala kwunyɔ ungwu enzu. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Wa ya rishi, oo za la kwuse ungwu Ɔbabilɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Apula iyeshi lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ gyi te kaa yi yi le i tomo-o, apula iyi kwuwo ŋɔ lɛɛbi mbala woshi ŋɔ lɛɛbi i kpo ɛdɔma-a, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ fya apula ɛlɛ ma gbee fo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Wa ya rishi, umba bɔkɔ o vindɔ enzu umba kwuwo mu rishi mbo iwomo mu kwuse kwɔngu awu, o ri shaaru, kwuwongu inyashi iyi Ɔbabilɔ li du mbo mo. O lo oga o wo ubugyi <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />akwɛyi o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Kyakwokwo ira mbɛ bɔkɔ i du kwuse ungwɔkwu kwɔlɛ te! Enzu umba kwuse ungwu Ɔbabilɔ kwɔlɛ o koko o lo apula iyi ɔlinɛ, ifyobyo mbala ifyobyo yoo mu ɛnwu akwɛyi e kpo egolu, ekyi iyi abwa, mbala apula iyi abwa mu ɛnwu! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Akwɛyi mu awa ikpɛnyi apula iyi kwuwo iyi kwuse ungwu Ɔbabilɔ lɛɛbi ikpɛdɔma!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi ada iyi embyi mbala enzu umba luzɛ, enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo ɛduma mu kwoda mbala umba bɔkɔ ifyama mba akwu mu embyi awu, o ri shaaru, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />akwɛyi o lo oga gbɔrɔrɔ tabɔkɔ o ma uwu uwɔyi uwu bɔkɔ u ye mu kwuse ungwu Ɔbabilɔ ipwumo awu: &lt;&lt;I yi kwuse kwowa ungwɔkwu kyamate kwuse kwɔlɛ mo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />O kpo ɛmba kwumburu mu reshi, o lo oga akwɛyi o wo obobyi, o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Kyakwokwo kyakwokwo kwuse ungwɔkwu kwɔlɛ kwu kpo ɛdɔma-a! Kwuse kwɔlɛ akwu kwuse ungwu enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi ada iyi embyi mu risu o yi kwuwo kwuwongu rishi iyama mangwu! Akwɛyi mu awa ikpɛnyi byi apula lɛɛbi i kpo ɛdɔ ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Lunyi umba bɔkɔ lu yi moshi awu, la lu mwɔnyɛ, kwuwongu ikpɛdɔma iyi kwuse ungwu Ɔbabilɔ! La lu mwɔnyɛ , enzu umba Ukpo mbala wa zɛ ilɔ mbala anukenzu! Moo Ukpo a ngbɛ kwuse ungwu Ɔbabilɔ ɛdɔ ma-a kwuwongu kiya ingyi kwu wo awu!<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwakwuu uwufo e to kwokyi ungwɔkwu kyamate rimɛ ingyi riko tayi akwɛyi e to ngye pyo mu risu, a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Tegba Ɔbabilɔ uwakwuu ele o bo towo pyo la ekpasu akwɛyi o gba o ma wu gbee fo. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />O gba o pwa amwu iyi emburu mbala epwu iyi enzu, mbala wa kpa ombula mbala kwongangaraki, munyi ŋɔ fo! O gba o ma onzu uwu ɛduma iyi ewo iyinayina te munyi ŋɔ fo; o gba o pwa anu iyi ikpomo mu riko munyi ŋɔ fo! <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />O gba o ma ilemo iyi kambwu unga ɔyi munyi ŋɔ fo; o gba o pwa opwu uwu okopo mbala ɔnu uwu okopo munyi ŋɔ fo. Wa ya rishi ŋɔ o ka ekpasu le mu kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi, akwɛyi i zɛ mu apula iyi amɛ iyi imwilo ŋɔ, ŋɔ kyoro enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi ma!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Ɔbabilɔ o lo wu inyashi kwuwongu ɛnzhi umba anukenzu mbala enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi o fu mbo mo mu kwuse kwɔngu; ee, ɛnzhi umba enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o ngbɛ mba ma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ mi pwa anu kyamate anu iyi riba ingyi enzu moshi, tee, &lt;&lt;Iduma lakwu iyi Ukpo! Isama, inzumbɛku, mbala ekpasu la akwiyi Ukpo nzu! <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Ototo mbala ongbulolo gba akwu ombu izɔma wu le. A ngbɛ u to kaya uwu bɔkɔ e tutu kwudu kwɔlɛ ma mu kaya wu awu ɛdɔma-a. Ukpo e lo wu inyashi kwuwongu a ngbɛ ɛmɛgba wu ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />O gba o wo anu kpɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Iduma akwiyi Ukpo! Uwu uwɔyi uwu bɔkɔ u yi mu kwuse ungwɔkwu kwɔngu ipwumo awu u ka moshi iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Enzumbakɔ uwekpepo la wendo mbala apula iyi bɔkɔ i fɛnyɔ ekpendo ɛnyi i kpo mbamba mɛzhi akwɛyi o gbo Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma mu ukpa uwɛsu ɔya. O zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Li yi tayi! Iduma lakwu iyi Ukpo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odumudumu Uwu Okopo Itomo Uwu Umɛ Uwu Ilɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Akwɛyi opwu u wɔ mbaa ukpa uwɛsu, u zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Iduma akwiyi Ukpo nzu, ɛmɛgba wu mbala enzu lɛɛbi, ikyo enzumbakɔ mbala enzu umbɛri, umba bɔkɔ o yi iyi wu awu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Akwɛyi mi pwa anu kyamate riba ingyi enzu tayi, kyamate embyi o yi mu ikalama moshi tayi, kyamate ina. Mi pwa o zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Iduma lakwu iyi Ukpo! Moo Ɔkwu, Ukpo nzu Edego ala, akwu Ɔsu! <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />La ki mwɔnyɛ la ki yi ubwu uruwu; la ki du wu ma kwuwongu imbwulama wu! Moo kwuye kwu bo-o ungwu bɔkɔ o wo okopo uwu Umɛ uwu Ilɔ, okopo wu ba e yi ɛnwu ma kwuwo yi-e. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Ukpo ba e shi wu okpayi uwu ɔlinɛ uwu a wuluma sɛsɛsɛ-ɛ.&gt;&gt; (Ɔlinɛ awu akwu ɛduma iyeshi iyi enzu umba Ukpo.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Ka ɛlɛ ma: Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o ya mba ma tee lo bo mu odumudumu uwu okopo uwu Umɛ uwu Ilɔ.&gt;&gt; Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu e so kpɔ te, &lt;&lt;Ɛlɛ gba akwu ongbulolo uwu iso iyi Ukpo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Mi kpo eyi mɛzhi midu wu kaa mi gbo wu ɔya, uwu ba a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Ki wo tayi mo! Imi tete mi kwu umɛgba kyamate uŋɔ mbala wa mbwalu umbafo tayi, enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o ra la ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a wawu kwudu. Lo gbo Ukpo ɔya kɛɛkyi!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Moo ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a wawu kwudu awu gba akwu kiya ingyi ki shi anukenzu ekpasu le.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="ms">Onzu Uwu A Ya Mu Ɔnya Uruwu Awu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Akwɛyi mi ma oshi u wuma, akwɛyi mi ma Onya uruwu mɔmɔ. Onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ya ma wu ele o ya wu te Ikwidufulo mbala Ongbulolo; mu ototo wu gba a zɔ ombu mbala ewa itomo wu le. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Eyi wu i yi kyamate ɔtinɛ uwu ɔyi te, akwɛyi a bɔ anuma umba riba mu reshi wu. E yi ɛnyi iyi o ka mɛnwu wu, onzu ukpukpɛnyi te ba e yitu yi mo, uwu kɛɛkyi gba e yitu yi le. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Ekpayi iyi bɔkɔ e lo le o lo yi mu ɛnzhi. Ɛnyi wu akwu &lt;&lt;Iso iyi Ukpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Asozha umba oshi o ya mu anya umba inyi iruwu o mbwalu wu akwɛyi o lo ekpayi iruwu sɛsɛsɛ iyi ɔlinɛ. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Ukpandɛrɛ uwu irimo a wɔ mu kenzu wu, mawu gba a byi ekeshi ma le. E ri ɛsu mu kwuwo ungwu ekpasu, a kpa agewa wu ata kyamate bɔkɔ onzu a kpa imuma iyi uwɛyi ata tayi. E wo ɛlɛ kwuwongu Ukpo Edego ala e wo amba. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Mu ekpayi wu mbala ubwu uwu kwɔlɛ wu i yi ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ o ka tee: &lt;&lt;Ɔsu uwu asu mbala Ɔkwu uwakwu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Akwɛyi mi ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwufo tabɔkɔ a ri mu kadu unga ɔnu. E wo anu mu opwu uwɔkwuu a ya afyi umboshi umba bɔkɔ o o yi mu iyimo moshi awu ma te: &lt;&lt;La lu bu kpala ɛlu mbaa odumudumu uwu Ukpo uwakwuu ele! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />La lu bo kaa la lu kwu ivye iyi asu, asozha umbakɔ, mbala asozha umbɛri, ivye iyi anya mbala umba bɔkɔ o ya ma anya umba inyi, ivye iyi enzu lɛɛbi, enye mbala umba bɔkɔ o kwu enye mo, umbakwu mbala umbɛri!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Akwɛyi mi ma izɔfyi awu mbala asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ mbala asozha umba o kpala ɛlu kaa lo to ewa mbala onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ya mu kadu unga Onya uwu inyi awu mbala asozha wu. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Izɔfyi awu Ukpo a ta wu mu ugu ugyi, mbala anukenzu u mwilo uwu bɔkɔ e wo apula iyi amɛ mu idu mbo awu. (I zɛ meka iyi apula iyi amɛ ɛnyi gba e kyoro enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi kwɔzu ungwu izɔfyi awu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o gbo uwɔ uwu izɔfyi awu ɔya.) Izɔfyi awu mbala anukenzu uwu imwilo awu kpɛkpɛ mba o to mbo la reyi o fu mba mu kwoba ungwɔyi ungwu bɔkɔ kwu pwumo laa uzu ɔyi. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Ukpo a ngbɛ asozha mba ma mu ukpandɛrɛ uwu bɔkɔ a wɔ mu kenzu unga onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ya mu kadu unga Onya uwu inyi awu; akwɛyi afyi umboshi lɛɛbi o kwu ivye mba nzhii ba ɛnwu i kwu mbo mo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Lɔri Odubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Akwɛyi mi ma ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a wɔ moshi e yi mu inyɔma mɛzhi, a rala anu iyi kwuvɔ ungwu indomo ngwu kwu yi ibɔma mo mbala ɛyɛ iyɛku mu kwuwo wu. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Akwɛyi e yi ɔduragɔ awu ma, ɔkwu uwekyi awu, Onzu uwoyi awu, naa Osheta, akwɛyi e lo wu ɛyɛ nzhii ba lɔri odubu. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a ta wu mu kwuvɔ ungwu indomo ngwu kwu yi ibɔma mo awu, e koko ngwu mo akwɛyi e lo ngwu mo, kaa le kyoro enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ ma fo nzhii ba lɔri odubu lu pikama. Mizhikembo iyi ɛlɛ o lu wu afyima iyi kwuye bwɛɛ.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Akwɛyi mi ma ikpa iyɛsu, enzu umba bɔkɔ o ŋɔma ma yi awu o shi mbo ekpasu kaa lo zɔ ombu. Mi gba mi ma enzu umba bɔkɔ o ngbɛ mba ma kwuwongu o ta anu iyi ongbulolo uwu bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi a wa wu kwudu mbala iso iyi Ukpo. O gbo oya la izɔfyi awu naa uwɔ wu dɛ-ɛ mo, nana o na kwɔzu ungwu izɔfyi mu undu mbo naa ewo mbo mo. O gba la eyi inyima akwɛyi o ri ɛsu mbala Okrasi nzhii ba lɔri odubu. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Enzu umba bɔkɔ o shi mo bɔkɔ o kpomo awu o gba la eyi inyima mo nzhii ba lɔri odubu lu pikama dɛ.) Ɛlɛ gba akwu iyimo mu kwuvɔ iyi kwonze iyi enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo le. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Ɔnyɛ mbala Ɔkɛrikɛri uwakwuu akwu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kyo mu iyimo mu kwuvɔ iyi kwonze. Lukwu undopo lu yi ekpasu mamba fo; o kwu ebwoshi umba Ukpo mbala umba Okrasi, akwɛyi o ri ɛsu mbala wu lɔri odubu.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibyima Iyi Osheta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Mizhikembo iyi lɔri odubu lu ka ma, ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a wa la Osheta ma mu ugu ugyi, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />akwɛyi Osheta a wɔ kwudu e re mbaa ekeshi umba kwudu kwɔlɛ lɛɛbi e kyoro mbo mo, inyi gba akwu, Ɔgɔgi mbala Ɔmagɔ le. Osheta a kpala mba ɛlu kwuwongu ewa itomo, riba mba ri yi kyamate ɔgyɛ uwu risu tayi. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Asozha o fu kwudu akwɛyi o lo enzu umba Ukpo mbala kwuse ungwu bɔkɔ Ukpo e pwu idɛnyi ngwu awu kwukpo. Ɔyi ba u wɔ moshi akwɛyi u pwu mbo mo. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Akwɛyi Onzu uwoyi, uwu bɔkɔ e kyoro mbo mo awu, o towo pyo o ta mu kwoba ungwu ɔyi mbala uzu uwu ɔyi, mbaa bɔkɔ izɔfyi awu mbala anukenzu u mulo o ta mba mɔmɔ-ɔ awu; umba ba o ma inyashi la utu la ɔnu iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ombwu Izɔma Umbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Akwɛyi mi ma ukpa uwɛsu uruwu uwakwuu mbala onzu uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma ma wu. Akwɛyi oshi mbala ɛzhi i tomo midu wu akwɛyi o gba o ma yi fo. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Akwɛyi mi ma enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo-o, la enzu umbakwu la umbɛri, o rima mu keyi unga ukpa uwɛsu. O wu ekpo mo akwɛyi o gba o wu kwokpo unguwufo ungwu kwunyɔ ma. Akwɛyi o zɔ ombu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo mu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ o wo, kyamate bɔkɔ o ka yi ma mu ekpo ɛnyi awu. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Akwɛyi risu ri wala enzu umba bɔkɔ o kpomo ma ngyi awu. Lukwu mbala aleku i wala ɛkpɛzhi mba kwudu tete. Akwɛyi o zɔ yi ombu mu ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ i wo. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Akwɛyi o to lukwu mbala aleku pyo o ta mu kwoba ungwɔyi. ( Kwoba ungwɔyi kwɔlɛ gba akwu lukwu undopo le.) <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ o ka ɛnyi ma mu kwokpo ungwu Kwunyɔ mo o to wopyo o ta mu kwoba ungwɔyi.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Oshi Uwepo Mbala Ɛzhi Iyepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Akwɛyi mi ma oshi uwepo mbala ɛzhi iyepo. Ɛzhi iyi iyi kwonze mbala oshi uwu kwonze i tomo, akwɛyi risu ri tomo tete. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Akwɛyi mi ma kwuse kɔ kɛrikɛri, Ɔzhɛrusalɛ uwepo, e yi mu ikalama moshi mbaa Ukpo, o nɔngɔ wu ma, kyamate okopo uwu bɔkɔ o wo wu agya ka le so le du ɔnu uwu tayi. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Mi pwa opwu uwɔkwuu u wɔ mbaa ukpa uwɛsu u yi mu iso isomo tee: &lt;&lt;Kwogba ungwu Ukpo kwu yi mbala enzu kekelele-e! Aa ŋɔ mbala mba, umba ba akwu enzu wu. Ukpo mafyi wu ee yi mbala mba, akwɛyi akwu Ukpo mbo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />A nwu mba ɛnyɛ ma meyi. Lukwu lu yi fo, ubugyi naa oga ilomo naa inyashi i yi fo. Apula iyekyi i kama-a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Akwɛyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔma mu ukpa uwɛsu wu awu a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Kekelele mi wo apula iyepo!&gt;&gt; A gba za mi kpɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ka yi ma, moo iso ɛlɛ akwu ongbulolo uwu o kwidu o fulo ma yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Akwɛyi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;O mbwa-a! Imi gba mi kwu Alifa mbala Omega le, iyomo mbala imbwama. Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ ugbebi u wo wu mo mii shi wu embyi mbaa itumo iyi embyi kaa le wo rɛshi. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o ri mo, o na ɛlɛ mbaa mi: Imi mii kwu Ukpo mbo, umba ba oo kwu ɛmɛ mi. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ oo wiyi, wa wo iri, wa wo apula iyi kashi, wa ngbɛ enzu mbala watokaya mbala wa wo emondo, wabyeshi mbala wa mulo, kizɛ mba akwu mu kwoba ungwu ɔyi mbala uzu uwɔyi, iyi bɔkɔ akwu lukwu undopo le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔzhɛrusalɛ Uwepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Akwɛyi ukpɛnyi meka iyi alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo werewo umba bɔkɔ o za laa lɔɔtu lorowo undu lu nyɔlɔma la ira ekperewo iyi imbwambwa awu e bo munyi mi akwɛyi a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Bo akwɛyi mi zɔ ŋɔ Okopo, oko uwu Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo e fye mami, akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo e to mi a ka mya mu ikerengbe iyi lɔwa undɔkwuu. A zɔ mi Ɔzhɛrusalɛ, kwuse kwɔ kɛrikɛri kwɔngu, kwu wɔ moshi mbaa Ukpo kwu yi mu ikalama <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />laa ilemo iyi inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo. Kwuse kwɔngu kwu lemo kyamate ekyi iyi abwa, kyamate ozhasipa, i wuluma sɛsɛsɛ kyamate umɛbɛ tayi. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Kwuse kwɔngu kwu yi kwukoga wɔzhi ungwɔkwu, mbala lunzugu uwo la lopo, alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo wewo la wepo umba bɔkɔ o gbo lunzugu ndɔndu ma. Mu lunzugu ndɔndu o ka ɛnyi iyi lunzu uwo la lopo undu Izirɛ. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kwuko ungwunanguna kwu yi lunzugu lola: lunzugu lola mu ɔnu uwu kwoto, lola mu okanga uwu ɔnu uwu onoyo, lola mu okanga uwu ɔnu uwu kwoto mbala lola mu ɔnu uwu onoyo. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Kwukoga ungwu kwuse kwɔngu o mbo ngwu mu ola uwu ekyi uwo la epo, mu ekyi ɛnyi o ka ɛnyi iyi wa zɛ ilɔ wewo la wepo umba Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e so mi iso le a ra laa upi uwu egolu uwu kasa ikpama kaa la kpakwuse kwɔngu mbala lunzugu ngwu mbala kwukoga kasa. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Igɔ iyi kwuse kwɔngu akwu kyakya, wowa ngwu mbala wɔzhi ngwu akwu kyakya. Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a kpa kwuse kwɔngu kasa mu upi uwu kasa ikpama: wɔzhi ngwu akwu emelu odubu la ederi ɛlɔ, wɔzhi ngwu mbala wowa ngwu mbala ibulɔma ngwu akwu kyakya. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a kpa kasa unga kwukoga kwɔngu, wɔzhi ngwu akwu ata ederi epo laa uwo la ɛrɛnyi, a kpa kyamate bɔkɔ enzu o kpa kasa mu kwuye mba awu. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Kwukoga kwɔngu o mbo ngwu mu ozhasipa, kwuse kwɔngu ba o mbo mu egolu iyi i wuluma sɛsɛsɛ kyamate umɛbɛ tayi. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Ɔla uwu ekyi uwu kwukoga ungwu kwuse kwɔngu o wo yi agya mu ekyi iyi abwa ikikɔ ikikɔ. Ɔla uwu kwokyi ungwu kwonze akwu mu ozhasipa, uwopo akwu mu osafaya, uwola akwu mu agate, uwondo akwu mu ɛmiradi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />ungwɔlɔ akwu onisi, uwɔrɛnyi akwu mu okaneliya, uworowo akwu mu okwas, uworanda akwu mu ɔbɛri, uworondo akwu mu otopazi, uwuwo akwu mu oshalidoni, uwu uwo la kwukpɛnyi akwu mu Otukosi, uwuwo la uwopo akwu mu amɛtisi. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Lunzugu luwo la lopo ndɔndu o wo ndu mu lɔkyɛ; kenzugu unganangana o wo ngo mu kakyɛ. Ɔgwuzɛ uwu kwuse kwɔngu o wo wu mu egolu, u yi sɛsɛsɛ kyamate umɛbɛ tayi.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Mi ma ɔtɛpu mu kwuse kwɔngu mo, moo ɔtɛpu uwu kwuse kwɔngu akwu Ɔkwu Ukpo Edego ala mbala Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Kwuse kwɔngu kwu yi ugɔ uwu ɔnu naa ovya kaa li lemo mangwu mo, moo inzumbɛku iyi Ukpo i lemo ma ngwu, Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu gba akwu kambu unga ɔyi ngwu le. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Enzu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ oo zɛ o mbwalu ɛbɛ ngwu. Asu umba kwudu kwɔlɛ o nya la apula iyi kwuwo mbo ma ngwu. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Lunzugu undu kwuse kwɔngu lu yi ɛwu kwuyengwunanguna, o koko ndu mo mo, kwuwongu utu u yi mɔmɔ mo. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />inzumbɛku mbala kiya ingyi kwuwo ingyi ekeshi o nya ya mu kwuse kwɔngu. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Kiya ingyi bɔkɔ ki wuluma mo ba ki fye mu kwuse kwɔngu mo, naa onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo apula iyi lovya naa a mwilo e fye mo. Enzu umba bɔkɔ ɛnyi mba o ka yi ma mu kwokpo ungwu enzu umba o ye la reyi ungwu Umɛ uwu Ilɔ awu kɛɛkyi gba o fye mu kwuse kwɔngu le.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo awu a zɔ mi ɔkwu uwu bɔkɔ u yi embyi umba kwunyɔ, u lemo meyi mate umɛbɛ tayi, o wɔ mbaa ukpa uwɛsu uwu Ukpo mbala Umɛ uwu Ilɔ <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />o yi mu irima mekeka iyi ɔgwuzɛ uwu kwuse kwɔngu. Mu igɔ igɔ iyi risu ngɛngyi uwɛyi uwu kwunyɔ u yi mɔmɔ, uwu bɔkɔ u wa la imuma izhi uwo la epo mu kari, u gba u wa la imuma kwuzhikpɛnyi mu ovya; epu yi ba akwu iyi ekeshi lɛɛbi efya ibomo. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e to ngyi mo, ki yi mu kwuse kwɔngu mo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Ukpa uwɛsu uwu Ukpo mbala uwu Umɛ uwu Ilɔ ii yi mu kwuse kɔngwu, akwɛyi ɛmɛgba wu ba oo lɛ wu ma.<verse eid="REV 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />O ma eyi wu, ɛnyi wu ba o ka yi ma mu undu mbo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Utu u yi fo, ugɔ uwu ɛbɛ naa ɔnu a kpama fo, kwuwongu Ɔkwu Ukpo gba akwu ɛbɛ mba le, akwɛyi o ri ɛsu iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inyɔma Iyi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Akwɛyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu Ukpo a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Iso ɛlɛ akwu ongbulolo ba o kwidu o fulo ma yi. Akwɛyi Ɔkwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ e shi Kwundu wu la anukenzu awu, a lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ wu kaa la zɔ ɛmɛgba wu kiya ingyi bɔkɔ akwu mega te ki wo kekelele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La lu pwa!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Imi mi yi mu inyɔma kekelele! Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o lomo la anu itama iyi iso iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kwokpo le!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Imi, Ɔzhɔnu mi pwa mi gba mi ma apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi, gba kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi mbwa apula ipwama mbala imama, mi kpo eyi mbwe mɛzhi mu idu iyi ɔlɔgbulɔ uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ mi apula ɛlɛ awu, Imi ba mi gyi te la mi gbo wu ɔya. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Uwu ba a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Ki wo tayi mo! Imi mi kwu umɛgba kya mbala ŋa mbala ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ anukenzu mbala enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o lomo la iso iyi i yi mu kwokpo kwɔlɛ.Gbo Ukpo ɔya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Akwɛyi a za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Uŋɔ ki nvye iso iyi anu itama iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kwokpo kwɔlɛ le mo mo, moo kwuye kwu bo kɛlɛ-ɛ bɔkɔ apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i wo. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo ira le so wu mu ira iwomo, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo apula iyi ɛnyinyi le so wu mu iwomo; onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e wo esheshi le so wu mu iwomo, onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e yi kɛrikɛri le so wu mu i yi kɛrikɛri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Ɔzhizɔsi a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;La lu pwa!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Mi yi mu inyɔma kekelele! Mi nyɔ mbala rigbɛ mi, kaa mi shi uwewe kyamate bɔkɔ e wo. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Imi gba mi kwu Alifa mbala Omega le, uyo mbala umbwambwaa le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Ɔnyɛ akwu uwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o gbɔ ekpayi iruwu mbo mo sɛsɛ kwuwongu o fya ekpasu te o ri imwuma iyi uwɛyi uwu kwunyɔ akwɛyi o zɛ mu lunzugu o fye mu kwuse. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Enzu umba o yi mu kwudu ungwu kwuse kwɔngu ba akwu enzu umba bɔkɔ oo wo apula iyi kashi, mbala wa wo emondo, mbala wa wo inyama, mbala wa ngbɛ enzu, mbala wa byeshi mbala wa mwangba mu iso mbo mbala iwomo mbo.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />&lt;&lt;Imi, Ɔzhizɔsi, gba mi lɔ ɔlɔgbulɔ mi ma kaa la ta yi anu iyi iso ɛlɛ mu ɛshɔshi le. Imi mi wɔ mu ɛdɔ iyi Odevidi; Imi mi kwu kwulovyo ungwu awalɔkyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Kwundu mbala Okopo ɔ za mi tee, &lt;&lt;Bo!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso ɛlɛ la zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Bo&gt;&gt; tete</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ ugbembyi u wo wu mo, &lt;&lt;Le bo&gt;&gt;; onzu uwu bɔkɔ a gyi embyi umba kwunyɔ, la na rɛshi.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Imi, Ɔzhɔnu, mi yi onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a pwa iso iyi anukenzu iyi kwokpo kwɔlɛ malu: akwiyi gba onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ e kyo yi mo, Ukpo e kyo wu inyashi iyi bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo kwɔlɛ ma. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a gyi kiya ingyinangyina ma mu iso iyi anukenzu iyi kwokpo kwɔlɛ ma, Ukpo a gyi ogbo wu uwu imwuma iyi uwɛyi uwu kwunyɔ mbala kwuse kɔ kɛrikɛri ma, iyi bɔkɔ o ka mu kwokpo kwɔlɛ.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to izɔgɔ iyi apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi le a zɔ tee, &lt;&lt;Ee iyesheshi! Imi mi yi mu inyɔma kekelele!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Li yi tayi. Bo, Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Esheshi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi li yi mbala uwewe.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>